Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.25,0:01:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't let you out，Hedwig.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.49,0:01:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not allowed to use magic outside of school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.42,0:01:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Besides，if Uncle Vernon… - Harry Potter！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now you've done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.47,0:01:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's in there。Vernon？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.61,0:01:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm warning you，if you can't control that bloody bird，it'll have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.95,0:01:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,But she's bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.51,0:01:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I could only let her out for an hour or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.19,0:01:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you can send secret messages to your freaky little friends？No，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.32,0:01:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I haven't had any messages from any of my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.63,0:01:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not one…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.70,0:02:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,all summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.33,0:02:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who would want to be friends with you？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.84,0:02:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should think you'd be a little more grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.44,0:02:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've raised you since you were a baby，given you the food off our table…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.98,0:02:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,even let you have Dudley's second bedroom…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.43,0:02:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,purely out of the goodness of our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.38,0:02:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Not now。It's for when the Masons arrive。- Which should be any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.79,0:02:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，let's go over our schedule once again，shall we？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.79,0:02:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Petunia，when the Masons arrive，you will be…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.03,0:02:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,In the lounge，waiting to welcome them graciously to our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.79,0:02:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good。And，Dudley，you will be… - I'll be waiting to open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.96,0:02:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.34,0:02:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.74,0:02:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be in my bedroom，making no noise and pretending that I don't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.28,0:02:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Too right，you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.18,0:02:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,With any luck，this could be the day I make the biggest deal of my career…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.85,0:02:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,and you will not mess it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.54,0:03:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter，such an honor it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.24,0:03:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who are you？- Dobby，sir。Dobby the house-elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.75,0:03:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not to be rude or anything…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.62,0:03:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,but this isn't a great time for me to have a house-elf in my bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.55,0:03:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir。Dobby understands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.22,0:03:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just that Dobby has come to tell you…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.49,0:03:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is difficult，sir。Dobby wonders where to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.50,0:03:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why don't you sit down？- Sit down？Sit down？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.57,0:03:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby，I'm sorry。I didn't mean to offend you or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Offend Dobby？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.58,0:03:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby has heard of your greatness，sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.08,0:04:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,but never has he been asked to sit down by a wizard，like an equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.79,0:04:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't have met many decent wizards then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.59,0:04:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.16,0:04:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was an awful thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bad Dobby！Bad Dobby！- Stop，Dobby。Dobby，shush.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.07,0:04:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby，please，stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't mind that。It's just the cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.65,0:04:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bad Dobby。- Stop！Stop，Dobby。Please，be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.35,0:04:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.24,0:04:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby had to punish himself，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby almost spoke ill of his family，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.83,0:04:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Your family？- The wizard family Dobby serves，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.93,0:04:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby is bound to serve one family forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.10,0:04:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,If they ever knew Dobby was here…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.31,0:05:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,But Dobby had to come。Dobby has to protect Harry Potter。To warn him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.24,0:05:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter must not go back…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.84,0:05:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,to Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.59,0:05:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is a plot，a plot to make most terrible things happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.92,0:05:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,What terrible things？Who's plotting them？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.44,0:05:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.06,0:05:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay，I understand。You can't say。- Don't make me talk。I…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.21,0:05:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dobby。Dobby，put the lamp down。- Bad Dobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.77,0:05:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,So when they arrive at the ninth hole…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.02,0:05:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me the lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.31,0:05:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby，stop！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.16,0:05:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get in there and keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.33,0:05:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What the devil are you doing up here？- I was just…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.56,0:05:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just ruined the punch line of my Japanese golfer joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.93,0:05:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.87,0:06:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,One more sound and you'll wish you'd never been born，boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.11,0:06:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And fix that door。- Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,See why I've got to go back？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.98,0:06:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't belong here。I belong in your world，at Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.92,0:06:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's the only place I've got friends。- Friends who don't write to Harry Potter？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.73,0:06:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I expect they've been…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.80,0:06:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on。How do you know my friends haven't been writing to me？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.90,0:06:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter mustn't be angry with Dobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.17,0:06:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby hoped if Harry Potter thought his friends had forgotten him…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.42,0:06:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter might not want to go back to school，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.05,0:06:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Give me those。Now。- No！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.13,0:07:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby，get back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.60,0:07:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby，please，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.32,0:07:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter must say he's not going back to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.61,0:07:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't。Hogwarts is my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.71,0:07:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then Dobby must do it，sir，for Harry Potter's own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.67,0:07:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,It spread as far as the eye could see，all over the floor of this building.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.52,0:07:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,One plumber said，「Look at all that water。」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.86,0:07:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,The second plumber said，「Yes，and that's just the top of it。」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.17,0:07:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Mason.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.92,0:07:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vernon tells me that you're a wonderful golfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.64,0:07:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I play occasionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.71,0:07:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.68,0:07:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mrs。Mason.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where do you get your beautiful suits？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.66,0:07:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,All of my suits are tailor-made.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.53,0:08:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dudley.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.21,0:08:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wasn't there something you wanted to say？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.69,0:08:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Pudding。- Pudding？What pudding？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry。It's my nephew。He's very disturbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.20,0:08:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Meeting strangers upsets him。That's why I kept him upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.41,0:08:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，we have ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.06,0:08:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're never going back to that school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.89,0:08:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're never going to see those freaky friends of yours again。Never！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.92,0:09:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiya，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.33,0:09:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron。Fred。George。What are you all doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.17,0:09:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rescuing you，of course。Now，come on，get your trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.83,0:09:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,You better stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.47,0:10:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.34,0:10:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What was that？- What was it？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.55,0:10:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Potter！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，what's going on？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.85,0:10:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go。Go。Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on。- Come on，Harry，hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.13,0:10:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Petunia，he's escaping！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.17,0:10:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I've got you，Harry。- Come here！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let go of me！- No，boy！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.66,0:10:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,You and that bloody pigeon aren't going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.57,0:10:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get off！- Drive！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.36,0:10:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Right。- Right！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.02,0:10:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！No！No！No！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.18,0:10:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.09,0:10:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.73,0:11:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,By the way，Harry，happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.93,0:11:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.43,0:11:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.17,0:11:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.61,0:11:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Think it'd be all right if we had some？- Yeah，Mum will never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.40,0:12:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not much，but it's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.77,0:12:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think it's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.01,0:12:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where have you been？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.28,0:12:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，how wonderful to see you，dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.40,0:12:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Beds empty。No note。Car gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.31,0:12:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,You could have died。You could have been seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course，I don't blame you，Harry，dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.63,0:12:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,They were starving him，Mum。There were bars on his window.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.09,0:12:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you best hope I don't put bars on your window，Ronald Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.47,0:12:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Harry，time for a spot of breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.74,0:12:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here we are，Harry。Now，tuck in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.76,0:12:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it。There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.74,0:12:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mummy，have you seen my jumper？- Yes，dear，it was on the cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.85,0:12:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.85,0:13:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,What did I do？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.69,0:13:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ginny。She's been talking about you all summer。A bit annoying，really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.46,0:13:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Morning，Weasleys。- Morning，Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.03,0:13:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What a night。Nine raids。Nine！- Raids？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.36,0:13:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad works in the Ministry of Magic，in the Misuse of Muggle Artifacts Office.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.63,0:13:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad loves Muggles，thinks they're fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.57,0:13:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.71,0:13:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,And who are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.71,0:13:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，sir。I'm Harry，sir。Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.69,0:13:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good Lord。Are you really？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.12,0:13:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，Ron has told us all about you，of course。When did he get here？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.11,0:13:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,This morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.73,0:13:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your sons flew that enchanted car of yours to Surrey and back last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.89,0:13:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you really？How did it go？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.38,0:13:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean…That was very wrong indeed，boys。Very wrong of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，Harry，you must know all about Muggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.48,0:14:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me，what exactly is the function of a rubber duck？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.16,0:14:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，that'll be Errol with the post.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.63,0:14:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fetch it，will you，Percy，please？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.77,0:14:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Errol。- He's always doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.64,0:14:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，it's our Hogwarts letters。They've sent us Harry's as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.17,0:14:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dumbledore must know you're here。Doesn't miss a trick，that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.31,0:14:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。- This lot won't come cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.40,0:14:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The spell books alone are very expensive。- We'll manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.30,0:14:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's only one place we're going to get all of this。Diagon Alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.66,0:14:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.32,0:14:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here we are，Harry。You go first，dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,But Harry's never traveled by Floo powder before，Mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.67,0:14:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Floo powder？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.06,0:15:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,You go first，Ron，so that Harry can see how it's done。Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.77,0:15:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,In you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.21,0:15:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.21,0:15:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Diagon Alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.95,0:15:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see？It's quite easy，dear。Don't be afraid。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.19,0:15:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.59,0:15:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,In you go。That's it。Mind your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.96,0:15:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right。Now，take your Floo powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.94,0:15:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it，very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.04,0:15:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，don't forget to speak very，very clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.71,0:15:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Diagonally.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.66,0:15:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What did he say，dear？- Diagonally.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.44,0:15:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.04,0:17:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't touch anything，Draco.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.92,0:17:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.12,0:17:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Malfoy，what a pleasure to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.93,0:17:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,And young Master Malfoy too。Delighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.27,0:17:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I must show you，just in today，and very reasonably priced
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.63,0:17:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm not buying today，Borgin。I'm selling。- Selling？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.24,0:17:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Draco.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.96,0:17:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're aware，no doubt，that the Ministry of Magic…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.76,0:17:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,is conducting more raids on private houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.00,0:18:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's even rumors of a new Muggle Protection Act.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.40,0:18:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pure wizard blood is counting for less everywhere，I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.76,0:18:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.09,0:18:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyway，I brought a few items from home that might prove…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.31,0:18:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,embarrassing were the Ministry to call。Poisons and the like.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.71,0:18:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.04,0:18:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,That particular item is not for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.39,0:18:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I understand。It has unique qualities.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.76,0:18:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,One wouldn't want to see it falling into the wrong hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can keep the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.20,0:18:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,What did I say？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.07,0:19:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Touch nothing。- Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.00,0:19:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。We're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.72,0:19:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to do business with you，Mr。Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.24,0:19:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Always a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.01,0:19:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Looking for something？- No，I…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.94,0:19:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm just in the wrong place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.01,0:19:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.93,0:19:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.15,0:20:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Not lost，are you，my dear？- I'm fine，thank you。I was just going…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.62,0:20:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come with us。We'll help you find your way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.66,0:20:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。Please。- Harry？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.31,0:20:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hagrid！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.56,0:20:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing down here？Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.20,0:20:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a mess，Harry。Skulking around Knockturn Alley？Dodgy place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.95,0:20:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't want no one to see you there。People will think you're up to no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.03,0:20:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was lost，I…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.22,0:20:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on。What were you doing down there then？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.46,0:20:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Me？I was… I was looking for Flesh-Eating Slug Repellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.92,0:20:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're ruining all the school cabbages.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.46,0:20:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry。Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.69,0:20:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.63,0:21:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's so good to see you。- It's great to see you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.69,0:21:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,What did you do to your glasses？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.48,0:21:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oculus Reparo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.01,0:21:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I definitely need to remember that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.72,0:21:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll be all right now then，Harry？Right。I'll leave you to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.71,0:21:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay，bye。- Thank you。Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.46,0:21:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，everyone's been so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.90,0:21:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.29,0:21:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank goodness。We'd hoped you'd only gone one grate too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.88,0:21:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen，Mr。Gilderoy Lockhart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.91,0:21:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.11,0:21:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mum fancies him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.91,0:21:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make way there，please。Let me by，madam。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.44,0:21:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，little girl。This is for the Daily Prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.19,0:22:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,It can't be。Harry Potter？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.21,0:22:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.43,0:22:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.63,0:22:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice big smile，Harry。Together，you and I rate the front page.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.35,0:22:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen，what an extraordinary moment this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.14,0:22:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,When young Harry stepped into Flourish and Blotts this morning…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.61,0:22:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,to purchase my autobiography，Magical Me…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.18,0:22:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,which，incidentally，is currently celebrating…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.22,0:22:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,its 27th week atop the Daily Prophet bestseller list…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.22,0:22:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,he had no idea that he would，in fact，be leaving…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.76,0:22:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,with my entire collected works…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.40,0:22:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,free of charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.77,0:22:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，ladies？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.27,0:22:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，now you give me those，and I'll get them signed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.51,0:22:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,All of you wait outside。That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.11,0:23:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll bet you loved that，didn't you，Potter？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.83,0:23:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Famous Harry Potter。Can't even go into a bookshop without making the front page.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.96,0:23:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leave him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.07,0:23:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，Potter。You've got yourself a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.74,0:23:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，now，Draco，play nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.86,0:23:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.69,0:23:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lucius Malfoy。We meet at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.98,0:23:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.42,0:23:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your scar is legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.05,0:23:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,As，of course，is the wizard who gave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.76,0:23:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Voldemort killed my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.91,0:23:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was nothing more than a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.13,0:23:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must be very brave to mention his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.95,0:23:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or very foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.68,0:24:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fear of a name only increases fear of the thing itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.78,0:24:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you must be Miss Granger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.00,0:24:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，Draco has told me all about you。And your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.71,0:24:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Muggles，aren't they？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.33,0:24:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me see。Red hair，vacant expressions…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.80,0:24:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,tatty，secondhand book.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.52,0:24:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must be the Weasleys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.13,0:24:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's mad in here。Let's go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.70,0:24:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Well，well，well。Weasley senior。- Lucius.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.20,0:24:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Busy time at the Ministry，Arthur，all those extra raids？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.19,0:24:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I do hope they're paying you overtime…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.52,0:24:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,but judging by the state of this，I'd say not.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.66,0:24:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's the use in being a disgrace to the name of wizard…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.48,0:25:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,if they don't even pay you well for it？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.94,0:25:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have a very different idea about what disgraces the name of wizard，Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.09,0:25:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.81,0:25:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Associating with Muggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.99,0:25:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I thought your family could sink no lower.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.69,0:25:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll see you at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.57,0:25:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,See you at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.01,0:25:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 10：58。Come on。- The train will be leaving any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.07,0:25:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fred，George，Percy，you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.76,0:25:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.01,0:26:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,After you，dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.34,0:26:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Ginny，we'll get you a seat。Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.84,0:26:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.86,0:26:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What do you two think you're doing？- Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.34,0:26:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lost control of the trolley.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.73,0:26:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why can't we get through？- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.30,0:26:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,The gateway has sealed itself for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.94,0:26:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,The train leaves at exactly 11：00。We've missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.92,0:26:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，if we can't get through…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.63,0:26:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,maybe Mum and Dad can't get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.30,0:26:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe we should just go and wait by the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.95,0:27:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,The car.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.23,0:27:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.69,0:27:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，all we need to do is find the Hogwarts Express.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.44,0:27:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron，are you sure you know how to fly this？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.17,0:27:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.37,0:27:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look out！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.56,0:27:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aah！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.64,0:27:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron，I should tell you…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.98,0:27:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,most Muggles aren't accustomed to seeing a flying car.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.23,0:27:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.35,0:27:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.63,0:28:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no！The Invisibility Booster must be faulty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.18,0:28:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，then。Let's go lower。We need to find the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.71,0:28:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.03,0:28:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,All we need to do is catch up with the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.00,0:28:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can't be far behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.79,0:28:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do you hear that？- We must be getting close.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.75,0:28:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.87,0:28:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.16,0:29:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold on！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.79,0:29:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take my hand！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.11,0:29:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold on！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.51,0:29:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm trying。Your hand's all sweaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.69,0:29:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I think we found the train。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.20,0:29:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.84,0:30:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Up！Up！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.17,0:30:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not working！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.34,0:30:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Up！Ron，mind that tree！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.18,0:30:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop！Stop！Stop！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.63,0:30:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- My wand。Look at my wand。- Be thankful it's not your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.24,0:30:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's happening？- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.28,0:31:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，go！Fast！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.19,0:32:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scabbers，you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.39,0:32:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,The car！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.87,0:32:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad's gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.28,0:32:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,See you，Hedwig.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.95,0:32:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,So a house-elf shows up in my bedroom…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.50,0:32:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,we can't get through the barrier to platform 93/4…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.49,0:32:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,we almost get killed by a tree…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.00,0:32:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Clearly someone doesn't want me here this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.14,0:33:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，take a good look，lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.24,0:33:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,This night might well be the last you spend in this castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.98,0:33:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，dear，we are in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.75,0:33:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were seen by no less than seven Muggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.39,0:33:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how serious this is？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.86,0:33:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have risked the exposure of our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.36,0:33:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not to mention the damage you inflicted on a Whomping Willow…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.52,0:33:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,that's been on these grounds since before you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.07,0:33:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honestly，Professor Snape，I think it did more damage to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.75,0:33:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.98,0:33:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I assure you that were you in Slytherin，and your fate rested with me…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.52,0:33:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,the both of you would be on the train home tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.49,0:33:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- As it is… - They are not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.93,0:33:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor Dumbledore。Professor McGonagall.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.36,0:34:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Headmaster…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.03,0:34:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,these boys have flouted the Decree for the Restriction of Underage Wizardry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.11,0:34:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,As such…I am well aware of our bylaws，Severus…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.08,0:34:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,having written quite a few of them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.31,0:34:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,However，as head of Gryffindor house…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.72,0:34:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,it is for Professor McGonagall to determine the appropriate action.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.19,0:34:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll go and get our stuff，then.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.52,0:34:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you talking about，Mr。Weasley？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.13,0:34:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're going to expel us，aren't you？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.90,0:34:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not today，Mr。Weasley…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.20,0:34:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I must impress on both of you the seriousness of what you have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.74,0:34:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will be writing to your families tonight，and you will both receive detention.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.46,0:34:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now I suggest that we all return to the feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.46,0:34:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is a delicious-looking custard tart that I am most anxious to sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.27,0:35:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Filch，you dropped this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.98,0:35:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good morning，everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.38,0:35:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good morning，everyone。- Good morning，Professor Sprout.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.94,0:35:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome to Greenhouse Three，second years。Gather around，everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.44,0:35:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Today we're going to re-pot Mandrakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.51,0:36:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who here can tell me the properties of the Mandrake root？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.32,0:36:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，Miss Granger？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.49,0:36:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mandrake，or Mandragora…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.19,0:36:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,is used to return those who have been Petrified to their original state.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.17,0:36:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's also quite dangerous。The Mandrake's cry is fatal to anyone who hears it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.49,0:36:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excellent。Ten points to Gryffindor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.38,0:36:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,As our Mandrakes are still only seedlings…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.41,0:36:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,their cries won't kill you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.34,0:36:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,But they could knock you out for several hours，which is why I have given you earmuffs…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.42,0:36:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,for auditory protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.24,0:36:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,So could you please put them on，right away？Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.49,0:36:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Flaps tight down，and watch me closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.74,0:36:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,You grasp your Mandrake firmly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.98,0:36:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,You pull it sharply up out of the pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.95,0:36:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got it？And…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.98,0:36:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,now you dunk it down into the other pot…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.53,0:36:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,and pour a little sprinkling of soil to keep him warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.72,0:37:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Longbottom's been neglecting his earmuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.33,0:37:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，ma'am，he's just fainted。- Yes，well，just leave him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.85,0:37:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，on we go。Plenty of pots to go around.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.58,0:37:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Grasp your Mandrake and pull it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.06,0:37:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There's Nearly Headless Nick。- Hello，Percy，Miss Clearwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.11,0:37:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Sir Nicholas.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.96,0:37:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say it。I'm doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.19,0:37:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're doomed。- Hi，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.36,0:38:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Colin Creevey。I'm in Gryffindor too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.27,0:38:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hi，Colin，nice to meet you。- Say，do you think your friend here…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.24,0:38:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,could take a photo of me and you standing together？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.68,0:38:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，to prove I've met you。It's for my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.34,0:38:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's a milkman，you know。A Muggle，like all our family's been until me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.33,0:38:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one knew all the stuff I could do was magic till we got our Hogwarts letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.01,0:38:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Everyone just thought I was mental。- Imagine that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.80,0:38:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron，is that your owl？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.23,0:38:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bloody bird's a menace.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.11,0:38:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.87,0:38:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，everyone。Weasley's got himself a Howler.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.16,0:38:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on，Ron。I ignored one from my gran once。It was horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.41,0:39:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ronald Weasley！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.99,0:39:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,How dare you steal that car！I am absolutely disgusted！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.26,0:39:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your father's now facing an inquiry at work…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.22,0:39:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,and it's entirely your fault！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.99,0:39:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you put another toe out of line…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.02,0:39:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,we'll bring you straight home！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.74,0:39:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,And，Ginny，dear，congratulations on making Gryffindor.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.54,0:39:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your father and I are so proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.52,0:40:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me introduce you to your new Defense Against the Dark Arts teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.95,0:40:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.72,0:40:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gilderoy Lockhart…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.36,0:40:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Order of Merlin，Third Class…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.77,0:40:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,honorary member of the Dark Force Defense League…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.50,0:40:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,and five times winner…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.51,0:40:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,of Witch Weekly's Most-Charming-Smile Award.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.78,0:40:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I don't talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.64,0:40:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't get rid of the Bandon Banshee by smiling at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.37,0:40:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see you've all bought a complete set of my books。Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.37,0:40:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，I thought we'd start today with a little quiz.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.89,0:40:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.01,0:40:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just to check how well you've read them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.65,0:40:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.57,0:40:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,How much you've taken in.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.65,0:41:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at these questions。They're all about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.45,0:41:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,「What is Gilderoy Lockhart's favorite color？」
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.33,0:41:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,「What is Gilderoy Lockhart's greatest achievement to date？」
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.41,0:41:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have 30 minutes。Start…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.05,0:41:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.61,0:41:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hardly any of you remembered that my favorite color is lilac.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.09,0:41:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,But Miss Hermione Granger knew…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.01,0:41:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,that my secret ambition is to rid the world of evil…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.31,0:41:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,and market my own range of hair-care potions。Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.46,0:41:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，be warned.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.75,0:41:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is my job to arm you…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.90,0:41:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,against the foulest creatures known to wizardkind.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.72,0:42:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,You may find yourselves facing your worst fears in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.71,0:42:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Know only that no harm can befall you whilst I am here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.03,0:42:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I must ask you not to scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.01,0:42:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,It might provoke them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.21,0:42:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cornish pixies？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.96,0:42:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Freshly caught Cornish pixies.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.78,0:42:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Laugh if you will，Mr。Finnegan…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.22,0:42:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,but pixies can be devilishly tricky little blighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.55,0:42:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's see what you make of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.79,0:42:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on now，round them up。They're only pixies.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.85,0:42:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You just stay there！- Please，get me down！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.29,0:43:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get off me！- Stop。Hold still！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.39,0:43:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Peskipiksi Pesternomi！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.58,0:43:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll ask you three to just nip the rest of them back into their cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.15,0:43:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do we do now？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.04,0:43:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Immobulus！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.93,0:43:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why is it always me？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.57,0:44:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I spent the summer devising a whole new Quidditch program.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.65,0:44:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna train earlier，harder and longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.44,0:44:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.34,0:44:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where you think you're going，Flint？- Quidditch practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.43,0:44:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I booked the pitch for Gryffindor today。- Easy，Wood。I've got a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.95,0:44:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I smell trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.01,0:44:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,「I，Professor Severus Snape，do hereby give the Slytherin team…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.87,0:44:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,permission to practice today，owing to the need to train their new Seeker。「
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.39,0:44:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've got a new Seeker。Who？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.72,0:44:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Malfoy？- That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.52,0:44:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,And that's not all that's new this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.07,0:44:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Those are Nimbus 2001 s。How did you get those？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.04,0:44:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,A gift from Draco's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.17,0:44:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，Weasley，unlike some，my father can afford the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.24,0:44:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,At least no one on the Gryffindor team had to buy their way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.36,0:44:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,They got in on pure talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.17,0:45:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one asked your opinion，you filthy little Mudblood.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.68,0:45:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll pay for that one，Malfoy。Eat slugs！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.62,0:45:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,You okay，Ron？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.40,0:45:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.69,0:45:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Wow！Can you turn him around，Harry？- No，Colin，get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.04,0:45:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's take him to Hagrid's.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.39,0:45:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,He'll know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.62,0:45:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,This calls for a specialist's equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.76,0:46:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing to do but wait till it stops，I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.71,0:46:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay。- Better out than in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.51,0:46:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who was Ron trying to curse，anyway？- Malfoy。He called Hermione…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.76,0:46:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I don't know exactly what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.40,0:46:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,He called me a Mudblood.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.82,0:46:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He did not。- What's a Mudblood？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.92,0:46:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,It means 「dirty blood。」 Mudblood's a really foul name for someone who's Muggle-born.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.68,0:46:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone with non-magic parents。Someone like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.46,0:46:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not a term one usually hears in civilized conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.60,0:46:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,See，the thing is，Harry，there are some wizards，like the Malfoy family…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.63,0:46:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,who think they're better than everyone else because they're pure-blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.28,0:46:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.08,0:46:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.54,0:47:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,And it's codswallop to boot。Dirty blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.36,0:47:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why，there isn't a wizard alive today that's not half-blood or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.93,0:47:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,More to the point，they've yet to think of a spell that our Hermione can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.24,0:47:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.07,0:47:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you think on it，Hermione。Don't you think on it for one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.79,0:47:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，Harry，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.93,0:47:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you possibly imagine…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.56,0:47:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,a better way to serve detention…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.38,0:47:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,than by helping me to answer my fan mail？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.29,0:47:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.89,0:47:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fame is a fickle friend，Harry。Celebrity is as celebrity does.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.05,0:47:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.48,0:47:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.81,0:47:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.18,0:48:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.84,0:48:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- Sorry？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.64,0:48:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,That voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.87,0:48:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Voice？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.01,0:48:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Didn't you hear it？- What are you talking about，Harry？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.23,0:48:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you're getting a bit drowsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.79,0:48:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,And great Scott，no wonder。Look at the time。We've been here nearly four hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.36,0:48:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spooky how the time flies when one is having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.38,0:48:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spooky.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.46,0:48:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.67,0:48:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I smell blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.31,0:48:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me rip you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.74,0:48:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.14,0:48:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kill！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.54,0:49:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kill！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.58,0:49:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Kill！- Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.68,0:49:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Did you hear it？- Hear what？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.32,0:49:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That voice。- Voice？What voice？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.71,0:49:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I heard it first in Lockhart's office。And then again just…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.94,0:49:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.34,0:49:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's moving。I think it's going to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.60,0:49:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Kill？- Harry，wait！Not so fast！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.62,0:49:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.73,0:49:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I've never seen spiders act like that。- I don't like spiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.97,0:50:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.84,0:50:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,「The Chamber of Secrets has been opened。Enemies of the Heir，beware。」
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.29,0:50:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's written in blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.49,0:50:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.44,0:50:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Filch's cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.24,0:50:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Mrs。Norris.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.22,0:50:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Enemies of the Heir，beware。」
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.77,0:50:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll be next，Mudbloods.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.30,0:50:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's going on here？Go on。Make way，make way.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.78,0:51:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Potter？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.88,0:51:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.32,0:51:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mrs。Norris？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.20,0:51:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You've murdered my cat。- No。No.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.67,0:51:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.30,0:51:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll kill you！- Argus！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.52,0:51:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Argus，I…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.82,0:51:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everyone will proceed to their dormitories immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.08,0:51:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everyone except…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.71,0:51:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,you three.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.99,0:51:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ravenclaws，follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.81,0:51:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's not dead，Argus。She has been Petrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.01,0:51:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thought so。So unlucky I wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.11,0:51:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know exactly the countercurse that could've spared her.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.44,0:51:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,But how she has been Petrified，I cannot say.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.42,0:52:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ask him。It's him that's done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.27,0:52:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,You saw what he wrote on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.01,0:52:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not true，sir。I swear。I never touched Mrs。Norris.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.47,0:52:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Rubbish。- If I might，headmaster？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.29,0:52:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps Potter and his friends were simply in the wrong place at the wrong time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.65,0:52:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,However…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.69,0:52:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,the circumstances are suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.07,0:52:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I，for one，don't recall seeing Potter at dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.83,0:52:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that's my doing，Severus.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.16,0:52:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，Harry was helping me answer my fan mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.56,0:52:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's why Ron and I went looking for him，professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.43,0:52:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'd just found him when he said…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.43,0:52:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes，Miss Granger？- When I said I wasn't hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.28,0:52:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,We were heading back to the common room when we found Mrs。Norris.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.80,0:53:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Innocent until proven guilty，Severus。- My cat has been Petrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.11,0:53:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I want to see some punishment！- We will be able to cure her，Argus.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.87,0:53:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,As I understand it，Madam Sprout has a very healthy growth of Mandrake.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.95,0:53:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,When matured，a potion will be made which will revive Mrs。Norris.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.66,0:53:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,And in the meantime…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.94,0:53:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I strongly recommend caution…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.78,0:53:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,to all.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.79,0:53:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's a bit strange，isn't it？- Strange？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.29,0:53:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,You hear this voice，a voice only you can hear…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.33,0:53:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,and then Mrs。Norris turns up Petrified。It's just strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.20,0:53:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you think I should have told them？Dumbledore and the others，I mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.48,0:53:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you mad？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.10,0:54:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Harry。Even in the wizarding world，hearing voices isn't a good sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.78,0:54:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's right，you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.14,0:54:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could I have your attention，please？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.23,0:54:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。Now，today，we will be transforming animals…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.63,0:54:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,into water goblets.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.18,0:54:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like so.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.01,0:54:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,One，two，three。Vera Verto.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.50,0:54:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now it's your turn。Who would like to go first？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.70,0:54:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Weasley。「One，two，three。Vera Verto。」
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.36,0:54:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vera Verto！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.73,0:54:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,That wand needs replacing，Mr。Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.62,0:54:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes，Miss Granger？- Professor…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.73,0:55:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was wondering if you could tell us about the Chamber of Secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.52,0:55:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.18,0:55:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,You all know，of course…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.48,0:55:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,that Hogwarts was founded over a thousand years ago…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.53,0:55:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,by the four greatest witches and wizards of the age：
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.22,0:55:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Godric Gryffindor，Helga Hufflepuff…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.16,0:55:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rowena Ravenclaw and Salazar Slytherin.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.09,0:55:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，three of the founders coexisted quite harmoniously.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.52,0:55:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- One did not。- Three guesses who.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.15,0:55:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Salazar Slytherin wished to be more selective…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.78,0:55:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,about the students admitted to Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.27,0:55:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,He believed magical learning should be kept within all-magic families.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.02,0:55:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,In other words，pure-bloods.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.54,0:56:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unable to sway the others，he decided to leave the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.70,0:56:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，according to legend…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.20,0:56:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Slytherin had built a hidden chamber in this castle…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.94,0:56:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,known as the Chamber of Secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.56,0:56:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Though，shortly before departing，he sealed it…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.37,0:56:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,until that time when his own true Heir returned to the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.61,0:56:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Heir alone…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.02,0:56:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,would be able to open the Chamber…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.93,0:56:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,and unleash the horror within，and by so doing…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.00,0:56:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,purge the school of all those who…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.41,0:56:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,in Slytherin's view，were unworthy to study magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.10,0:56:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Muggle-borns.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.18,0:56:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Naturally，the school has been searched many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.85,0:56:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,No such chamber has been found.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.06,0:56:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor？What exactly does legend tell us lies within the Chamber？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.67,0:57:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Chamber is said to be home to something…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.43,0:57:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,that only the Heir of Slytherin can control.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.64,0:57:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is said to be the home…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.38,0:57:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,of a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.61,0:57:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you think it's true？Do you think there really is a Chamber of Secrets？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.70,0:57:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。Couldn't you tell？McGonagall's worried。All the teachers are.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.04,0:57:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,If there really is a Chamber of Secrets，and it really has been opened，that means-
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.05,0:57:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Heir of Slytherin has returned to Hogwarts。The question is，who is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.29,0:57:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's think。Who do we know who thinks all Muggle-borns are scum？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.73,0:57:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- If you're talking about Malfoy。- Of course。You heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.55,0:57:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,「You'll be next，Mudbloods。」
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.12,0:57:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I heard him。But Malfoy，the Heir of Slytherin？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.21,0:57:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe Ron's right，Hermione。I mean，look at his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.56,0:57:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,The whole lot of them have been in Slytherin for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.53,0:57:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crabbe and Goyle must know。Maybe we could trick them into telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.29,0:57:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even they aren't that thick。But there might be another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.67,0:58:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mind you，it would be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.81,0:58:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not to mention we'd be breaking about 50 school rules…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.95,0:58:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,and it'll be dangerous。Very dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.03,0:58:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here it is。The Polyjuice Potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.88,0:58:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Properly brewed，the Polyjuice Potion allows the drinker…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.82,0:58:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,to transform himself temporarily into the physical form of another。「
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.04,0:58:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,You mean if Harry and I drink that stuff，we'll turn into Crabbe and Goyle？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.28,0:58:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Wicked！Malfoy will tell us anything。- Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.76,0:58:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it's tricky。I've never seen a more complicated potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.75,0:58:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How long will it take to make？- A month.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.16,0:58:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,A month？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.88,0:58:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，Hermione，if Malfoy is the Heir of Slytherin…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.96,0:58:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,he could attack half the Muggle-borns in the school by then.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.33,0:58:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.23,0:58:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it's the only plan we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.92,0:59:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Another goal for Slytherin！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.96,0:59:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,They lead Gryffindor 90 to 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.53,0:59:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.36,0:59:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.17,1:00:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right there，Scarhead？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.83,1:00:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch yourself，Harry！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.73,1:00:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wood，look out！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.54,1:01:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron！Harry's got himself a rogue Bludger.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.54,1:01:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's been tampered with，that has.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.06,1:01:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll stop it。- No！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.46,1:01:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even with a proper wand，it's too risky。You could hit Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.60,1:01:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Training for the ballet，Potter？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.04,1:02:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll never catch me，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.99,1:03:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.43,1:03:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter has caught the Snitch。Gryffindor wins！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.98,1:04:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finite Incantatem！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.44,1:04:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thank you。- Are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.59,1:04:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。I think my arm is broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.54,1:04:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not to worry，Harry。I will fix that arm of yours straightaway.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.15,1:04:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Not you。- Boy doesn't know what he's saying.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.64,1:04:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,This won't hurt a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.80,1:04:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brackium Emendo！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.29,1:04:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，well，that can sometimes happen…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.57,1:04:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,but the point is…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.20,1:04:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,you can no longer feel any pain，and，very clearly，the bones are not broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.38,1:04:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Broken？There's no bones left.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.57,1:05:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Much more flexible，though.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.90,1:05:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Malfoy，stop making such a fuss。You can go。Out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.71,1:05:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Should have been brought straight to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.71,1:05:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can mend bones in a heartbeat，but growing them back…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.40,1:05:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will be able to，won't you？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.91,1:05:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be able to，certainly。But it'll be painful.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.68,1:05:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're in for a rough night，Potter。Regrowing bones is a nasty business.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.99,1:05:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you expect？Pumpkin juice？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.17,1:05:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.77,1:05:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.68,1:05:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Time to kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.71,1:05:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.26,1:05:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.83,1:06:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter should have listened to Dobby.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.56,1:06:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter should have gone back home when he missed the train.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.48,1:06:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was you。You stopped the barrier from letting Ron and me through.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.49,1:06:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Indeed。Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.64,1:06:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You nearly got Ron and me expelled。- At least you would be away from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.32,1:06:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter must go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.22,1:06:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby thought his Bludger would be enough to make Harry Potter see-
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.45,1:06:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your Bludger？You made that Bludger chase after me？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.56,1:06:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby feels most aggrieved，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.23,1:06:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby had to iron his hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.04,1:06:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,You better clear off before my bones come back，Dobby，or I might strangle you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.32,1:06:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby is used to death threats，sir。Dobby gets them five times a day at home.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.18,1:06:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't suppose you could tell me why you're trying to kill me？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.03,1:06:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not kill you，sir。Never kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.96,1:07:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby remembers how it was before Harry Potter triumphed…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.82,1:07:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,over He-Who-Must-Not-Be-Named.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.09,1:07:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,We house-elves were treated like vermin，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.96,1:07:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course，Dobby is still treated like vermin.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.26,1:07:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why do you wear that thing，Dobby？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.08,1:07:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,This，sir？It is a mark of the house-elf's enslavement.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.39,1:07:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby can only be freed if his master presents him with clothes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.27,1:07:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.14,1:07:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.92,1:07:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Terrible things are about to happen at Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.29,1:07:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter must not stay here…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.20,1:07:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,now that history is to repeat itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.87,1:07:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Repeat itself？You mean this has happened before？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.47,1:07:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have said that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.19,1:08:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bad Dobby！Bad！- Stop it！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.56,1:08:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop it，Dobby！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.06,1:08:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me。When did this happen before？Who's doing it now？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.83,1:08:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby cannot say，sir。Dobby only wants Harry Potter to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.09,1:08:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Dobby。Tell me。Who is it？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.91,1:08:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put him here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.48,1:08:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What happened？- There's been another attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.76,1:08:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think he's been Petrified，Madam Pomfrey.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.33,1:08:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look。Perhaps he managed to take a picture of his attacker.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.04,1:09:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,What can this mean，Albus？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.08,1:09:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,It means…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.23,1:09:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,that our students are in great danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.16,1:09:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What should I tell the staff？- The truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.90,1:09:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell them Hogwarts is no longer safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.00,1:09:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is as we feared，Minerva.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.01,1:09:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Chamber of Secrets has indeed been opened again.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.61,1:09:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Again？You mean the Chamber of Secrets has been opened before？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.87,1:09:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course。Don't you see？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.78,1:09:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lucius Malfoy must have opened it when he was at school here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.37,1:09:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Now he's taught Draco how to do it。- Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.31,1:09:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll have to wait for the Polyjuice Potion to know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.50,1:09:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Enlighten me。Why are we brewing this potion in broad daylight…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.69,1:09:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,in the middle of the girls' lavatory？Don't you think we'll get caught？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.63,1:09:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。No one ever comes in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.99,1:10:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why？- Moaning Myrtle.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.71,1:10:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.09,1:10:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Moaning Myrtle.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.20,1:10:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who's Moaning Myrtle？- I'm Moaning Myrtle.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.25,1:10:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wouldn't expect you to know me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.97,1:10:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who would ever talk about ugly，miserable…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.96,1:10:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,moping Moaning Myrtle？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.49,1:10:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's a little sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.17,1:10:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gather round！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.55,1:10:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gather round。Can everybody see me？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.53,1:10:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you all hear me？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.34,1:10:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.42,1:10:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,In light of the dark events of recent weeks…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.49,1:10:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor Dumbledore has granted me permission to start this Dueling Club…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.99,1:11:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,to train you all up in case you ever need to defend yourselves…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.16,1:11:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,as I myself have done on countless occasions.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.77,1:11:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,For full details，see my published works.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.75,1:11:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That Lockhart's something，isn't he？- Awfully brave chap.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.96,1:11:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Justin Finch-Fletchley。- Hufflepuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.15,1:11:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you。I'm…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.75,1:11:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know who you are。We all do。Even us Muggle-borns.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.79,1:11:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me introduce my assistant…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.03,1:11:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor Snape.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.80,1:11:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,He has sportingly agreed to help with a short demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.60,1:11:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want any of you youngsters to worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.01,1:11:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll still have your Potions master when I'm through with him。Never fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.74,1:12:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,One.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.58,1:12:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.20,1:12:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Three！- Expelliarmus！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.81,1:12:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do you think he's all right？- Who cares？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.64,1:12:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,An excellent idea to show them that，Professor Snape…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.88,1:12:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,but if you don't mind me saying，it was pretty obvious what you were about to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.67,1:12:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I had wanted to stop you，it would have been only too easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.07,1:12:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps it would be prudent to first teach the students…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.56,1:12:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,to block unfriendly spells，professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.80,1:12:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,An excellent suggestion，Professor Snape.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.47,1:12:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's have a volunteer pair。Potter，Weasley，how about you？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.15,1:12:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Weasley's wand causes devastation with the simplest spells.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.98,1:12:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll be sending Potter to the hospital wing in a matchbox.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.71,1:12:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Might I suggest someone from my own house？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.05,1:13:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Malfoy，perhaps？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.03,1:13:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good luck，Potter。- Thank you，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.51,1:13:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wands at the ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.11,1:13:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Scared，Potter？- You wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.52,1:13:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,On the count of three…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.42,1:13:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,cast your charms to disarm your opponent。Only to disarm.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.93,1:13:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't want any accidents here。One.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.23,1:13:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Two。- Everte Statum！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.45,1:14:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rictusempra！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.66,1:14:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I said disarm only.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.74,1:14:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Serpensortia！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.27,1:14:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't move，Potter。I'll get rid of it for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.43,1:14:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Allow me，Professor Snape。Alarte Ascendare！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.23,1:15:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vipera Evanesca.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.60,1:15:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you playing at？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.75,1:15:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a Parselmouth？Why didn't you tell us？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.83,1:15:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm a what？- You can talk to snakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.21,1:15:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know。I accidentally set a python on my cousin Dudley at the zoo once.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.53,1:15:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Once。But so what？I bet loads of people here can do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.66,1:16:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，they can't。It's not a very common gift，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.94,1:16:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.80,1:16:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's bad？If I hadn't told that snake not to attack Justin
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.71,1:16:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's what you said to it。- You were there。You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.38,1:16:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I heard you speaking Parseltongue。Snake language.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.45,1:16:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I spoke a different language？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.39,1:16:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I didn't realize
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.96,1:16:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,How can I speak a language without knowing I can？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.89,1:16:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know，but it sounded like you were egging the snake on or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.10,1:16:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.07,1:16:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a reason the symbol of Slytherin house is a serpent.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.23,1:16:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Salazar Slytherin was a Parselmouth。- He could talk to snakes too.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.01,1:16:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.21,1:16:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now the whole school's gonna think you're his great-great-great grandson.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.77,1:16:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.48,1:16:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't be.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.55,1:16:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,He lived a thousand years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.75,1:16:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,For all we know，you could be.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.33,1:17:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who am I，Hedwig？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.33,1:17:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What am I？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.89,1:17:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll see you back in the common room.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.94,1:18:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,So anyway，I told Justin to hide up in our dormitory.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.38,1:18:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean to say，if Potter's marked him down as his next victim…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.24,1:18:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,it's best he keeps a low profile for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.02,1:18:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,But why would he want to attack Justin？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.94,1:18:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，Justin let it slip to Potter that he was Muggle-born.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.58,1:18:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you definitely think Potter's the Heir of Slytherin？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.42,1:18:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hannah，he's a Parselmouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.38,1:18:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everyone knows that's the mark of a Dark wizard.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.24,1:18:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you ever heard of a decent one who could talk to snakes？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.27,1:18:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,They called Slytherin himself Serpent-tongue.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.81,1:18:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry always seems so nice，though.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.72,1:18:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,And，after all，he is the one who made You-Know-Who disappear.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.31,1:18:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's probably why You-Know-Who wanted to kill him in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.66,1:19:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Didn't want another Dark Lord competing with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.68,1:19:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Harry。You all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.13,1:19:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hagrid。What are you doing here？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.14,1:19:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Second one killed this term.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.39,1:19:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，I reckon it's either a fox or a Blood-Sucking Bugbear.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.93,1:19:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been up at Dumbledore's getting permission…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.56,1:19:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,…to put a little charm round the old hen coop.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.57,1:19:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,You sure you're all right？You're awful hot and bothered.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.69,1:19:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.82,1:19:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I'd better get going。I've got a lot of studying to…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.73,1:20:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.66,1:20:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,They all must die.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.16,1:20:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.10,1:20:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.90,1:20:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Time to kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.64,1:21:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Caught in the act.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.08,1:21:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll have you out this time，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.44,1:21:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.08,1:21:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Mr。Filch！You don't understand
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.84,1:21:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.25,1:21:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I swear I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.83,1:21:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is out of my hands，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.46,1:21:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor Dumbledore will be waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.98,1:22:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sherbet Lemon.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.68,1:22:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor Dumbledore？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.21,1:23:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bee in your bonnet，Potter？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.86,1:23:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was just wondering if you put me in the right house.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.74,1:23:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。You were particularly difficult to place.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.35,1:23:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I stand by what I said last year.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.94,1:23:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,You would have done well in Slytherin.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.63,1:23:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.10,1:23:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.89,1:24:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.33,1:24:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your bird… There was nothing I could do.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.55,1:24:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He just caught fire。- And about time too.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.87,1:24:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's been looking dreadful for days.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.49,1:24:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pity you had to see him on a burning day.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.28,1:24:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fawkes is a phoenix，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.64,1:24:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,They burst into flame when it is time for them to die…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.14,1:24:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,and then they are…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.33,1:24:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,reborn from the ashes.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.93,1:24:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fascinating creatures，phoenixes.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.05,1:24:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,They can carry immensely heavy loads.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.09,1:24:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Their tears have healing powers.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.45,1:24:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor Dumbledore，sir！Wait！Listen！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.53,1:24:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor Dumbledore，sir，it wasn't Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.00,1:24:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd be prepared to swear it in front of the Ministry of Magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.29,1:25:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hagrid！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.94,1:25:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.72,1:25:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I do not believe…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.93,1:25:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- that Harry attacked anyone。- Of course you don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.11,1:25:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。Well，I'll…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.08,1:25:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll just wait outside，then。- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.83,1:25:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You don't think it was me，professor？- No，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.53,1:25:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I do not think it was you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.24,1:25:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I must ask you…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.59,1:25:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,is there something you wish to tell me？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.02,1:25:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.05,1:25:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.63,1:25:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very well，then.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.91,1:25:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Off you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.39,1:26:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，look，everyone。It's the Heir of Slytherin.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.94,1:26:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be careful。He's a seriously evil wizard.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.35,1:26:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Harry。Fred and George were just having a laugh.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.47,1:26:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're the only ones.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.79,1:26:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,So half the school thinks you nip off to the Chamber of Secrets every night.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.01,1:26:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who cares？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.67,1:26:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe they're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.15,1:26:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry。Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.70,1:26:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on。- I didn't know I can speak Parseltongue.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.67,1:26:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,What else don't I know about myself？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.69,1:26:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.50,1:26:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,maybe you can do something…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.94,1:27:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,even something horrible，and not know you did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.81,1:27:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't believe that，Harry。I know you don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.90,1:27:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if it makes you feel any better，Malfoy's staying for the holidays too.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.27,1:27:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why would that make anyone feel any better？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.67,1:27:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because in a few days the Polyjuice Potion will be ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.16,1:27:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,In a few days，we may truly know who is the Heir of Slytherin.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.14,1:27:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everything's set。We just need a bit of who you're changing into.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.83,1:27:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crabbe and Goyle.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.82,1:27:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,We also need to make sure that the real Crabbe and Goyle…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.75,1:27:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,can't burst in on us while we're interrogating Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.32,1:28:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How？- I've got it all worked out.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.19,1:28:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I filled these with a simple Sleeping Draught.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.93,1:28:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Simple，but powerful.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.93,1:28:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，once they're asleep…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.49,1:28:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,hide them in the broomstick cupboard and pull out a few of their hairs…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.77,1:28:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,and put on their uniforms.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.82,1:28:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Whose hair are you ripping out，then？- I've already got mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.14,1:28:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Millicent Bulstrode。Slytherin.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.51,1:28:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got this off her robes.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.91,1:28:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to go check on the Polyjuice Potion.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.52,1:28:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make sure that Crabbe and Goyle find these.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.47,1:28:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron，maybe I should do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.00,1:28:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.27,1:28:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wingardium Leviosa.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.73,1:29:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.25,1:29:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.01,1:29:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,How thick could you get？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.01,1:29:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，let's get them.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.20,1:29:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，did you get the hairs？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.72,1:29:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are those？- Slytherin robes.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.72,1:29:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had to sneak them from the laundry.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.44,1:29:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are we going to drink that？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.48,1:29:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hum！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.64,1:30:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll have exactly one hour before we change back into ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.33,1:30:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Add the hairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.81,1:30:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Essence of Crabbe.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.74,1:30:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.35,1:30:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I'm gonna be sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.69,1:30:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.40,1:31:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.60,1:31:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.83,1:31:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bloody hell！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.88,1:31:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,We still sound like ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.31,1:31:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,You need to sound more like Crabbe.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.25,1:31:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bloody hell。- Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.17,1:31:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But where's Hermione？- I…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.63,1:31:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm going。You go on without me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.93,1:31:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione，are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.70,1:31:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just go。You're wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.50,1:31:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.67,1:32:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I think the Slytherin common room's this way。- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.01,1:32:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.16,1:32:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing d…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.38,1:32:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，what are you doing down here？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.35,1:32:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I happen to be a school prefect.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.25,1:32:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,You，on the other hand，have no business wandering the corridors at night.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.29,1:32:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are your names again？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.29,1:32:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm… - Crabbe，Goyle，where have you two been？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.47,1:32:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pigging out in the Great Hall all this time？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.00,1:32:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why are you wearing glasses？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.14,1:32:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Reading。- Reading？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.14,1:32:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't know you could read.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.32,1:32:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,And what are you doing down here，Weasley？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.58,1:32:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mind your attitude，Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.39,1:33:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.20,1:33:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'd never know the Weasleys were pure-bloods，the way they behave.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.27,1:33:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're an embarrassment to the wizarding world。All of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.94,1:33:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you，Crabbe？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.45,1:33:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stomachache.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.18,1:33:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I'm surprised the Daily Prophet hasn't done a report on all these attacks.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.19,1:33:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I suppose Dumbledore is trying to hush it all up.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.92,1:33:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Father always said Dumbledore was the worst thing…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.73,1:33:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- that ever happened to this place。- You're wrong！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.77,1:33:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.14,1:33:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think there's someone here who's worse than Dumbledore？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.98,1:33:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well？Do you？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.91,1:33:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.35,1:34:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good one，Goyle.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.92,1:34:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.13,1:34:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Saint Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.99,1:34:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,And people actually think that he's the Heir of Slytherin？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.53,1:34:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,But then you must have some idea who's behind it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.30,1:34:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know I don't，Goyle。I told you yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.90,1:34:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.48,1:34:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is this yours？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.79,1:34:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,But my father did say this：
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.55,1:34:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's been 50 years since the Chamber was opened.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.62,1:34:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,He wouldn't tell me who opened it。Only that they were expelled.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.30,1:34:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,The last time the Chamber of Secrets was opened，a Mudblood died.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.13,1:34:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,So it's only a matter of time before one of them is killed this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.04,1:34:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,As for me…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.04,1:34:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hope it's Granger.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.38,1:34:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you two？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.75,1:35:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're acting very odd.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.41,1:35:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's his stomachache.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.78,1:35:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.02,1:35:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.27,1:35:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.78,1:35:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Where are you going？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.09,1:35:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.53,1:35:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione，come out。We've got loads to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.25,1:35:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.62,1:35:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait till you see。It's awful.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.27,1:36:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.25,1:36:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.89,1:36:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you remember me telling you…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.00,1:36:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,that the Polyjuice Potion was only for human transformations？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.33,1:36:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was cat hair I plucked off Millicent Bulstrode's robes.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.73,1:36:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at my face.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.22,1:36:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at your tail.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.30,1:36:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you spoken to Hermione？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.15,1:36:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,She should be out of hospital in a few days…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.89,1:36:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,when she stops coughing up fur balls.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.34,1:36:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's this？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.80,1:36:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yuck！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.04,1:36:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks like Moaning Myrtle's flooded the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.06,1:37:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come to throw something else at me？- Why would I throw something at you？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.63,1:37:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't ask me。Here I am，minding my own business…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.17,1:37:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,and someone thinks it's funny to throw a book at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.70,1:37:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it can't hurt if someone throws something at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.77,1:37:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，it'll just go right through you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.21,1:37:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure！Let's all throw books at Myrtle because she can't feel it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.87,1:37:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ten points if you get it through her stomach！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.55,1:37:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fifty points if it goes through her head！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.55,1:37:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But who threw it at you，anyway？- I don't know。I didn't see them.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.32,1:37:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was just sitting in the U-bend，thinking about death…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.76,1:37:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,and it fell through the top of my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.38,1:38:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a name in this diary.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.76,1:38:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tom Marvolo Riddle.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.36,1:38:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tom Marvolo Riddle？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.92,1:38:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on。I know that name。Why do I know that name？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.72,1:38:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course。That night I had detention.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.96,1:38:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,My job was to polish the silver in the trophy room.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.28,1:38:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I remember because I kept burping up slugs over Tom Riddle's trophy.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.00,1:38:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What was the trophy for？- He won an award。50 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.88,1:38:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Special services to the school or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.64,1:38:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 50 years ago。Are you sure？- Yeah。Why？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.44,1:38:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you remember what Malfoy told you？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.60,1:38:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The last time the Chamber was opened was… - Fifty years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.90,1:38:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,But that means Tom Riddle was here at Hogwarts when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.12,1:39:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,What if he wrote about what he saw？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.96,1:39:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's possible he knew where the Chamber was…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.44,1:39:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,how to open it，even what sort of creature lives in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.20,1:39:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,If so，whoever's behind these attacks wouldn't want this diary lying around…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.16,1:39:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,would they？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.60,1:39:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a brilliant theory，Hermione，but there's just one flaw.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.17,1:39:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's nothing written in this diary.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.47,1:39:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you mind？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.88,1:39:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Tom Marvolo Riddle。」
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.27,1:40:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,My name…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.77,1:40:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,is Harry…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.07,1:40:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.69,1:40:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know anything…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.52,1:40:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,about the Chamber of Secrets？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.48,1:41:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.65,1:41:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,tell me？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.22,1:42:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me。Could you tell me what's going on here？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.94,1:42:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you Tom Riddle？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.47,1:42:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，can you hear me？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.66,1:42:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Riddle！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.20,1:42:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.02,1:42:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.10,1:42:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dumbledore？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.50,1:43:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is not wise to be wandering around this late hour，Tom.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.30,1:43:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，professor。I suppose I…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.80,1:43:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had to see for myself if the rumors were true.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.57,1:43:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm afraid they are，Tom。They are true.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.64,1:43:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,About the school as well？I don't have a home to go to.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.91,1:43:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,They wouldn't really close Hogwarts，would they，professor？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.68,1:43:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I understand，Tom，but I'm afraid…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.98,1:43:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Headmaster Dippet may have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.09,1:43:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，if it all stopped，if the person responsible was caught…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.67,1:43:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there something…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.90,1:43:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,you wish to tell me？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.94,1:43:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，sir。Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.41,1:43:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very well，then。Off you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.50,1:43:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good night，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.33,1:44:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let's get you out of there。- Evening，Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.85,1:44:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to have to turn you in，Hagrid。I don't think you meant it to kill anyone…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.36,1:44:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't。You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.83,1:44:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,The dead girl's parents will be here tomorrow。The least Hogwarts can do…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.18,1:44:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,is make sure the thing that killed their daughter is slaughtered.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.30,1:44:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,It wasn't him。Aragog never killed no one。Never.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.53,1:44:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Monsters don't make good pets，Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.07,1:44:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Now，stand aside。- No！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.87,1:44:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stand aside，Hagrid。- No！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.01,1:44:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cistem Aperio！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.58,1:45:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Arania Exumai！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.82,1:45:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aragog！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.46,1:45:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aragog！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.08,1:45:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't let you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.16,1:45:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,They'll have your wand for this，Hagrid。You'll be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.00,1:45:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hagrid！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.42,1:45:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.31,1:45:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron。Ron，wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.47,1:45:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.95,1:45:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was Hagrid。Hagrid opened the Chamber of Secrets 50 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.99,1:46:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,It can't be Hagrid。It just can't be.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.09,1:46:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't even know this Tom Riddle。He sounds like a dirty，rotten snitch to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.33,1:46:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,The monster had killed somebody，Ron。What would any of us have done？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.13,1:46:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，Hagrid's our friend。Why don't we just go and ask him about it？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.30,1:46:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,That would be a cheerful visit，「Hello，Hagrid…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.14,1:46:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell us，have you been setting anything mad and hairy loose in the castle lately？「
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.14,1:46:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mad and hairy？You wouldn't be talking about me，now，would you？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.68,1:46:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.18,1:46:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that you've got，Hagrid？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.25,1:46:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Flesh-Eating Slug Repellent。For the Mandrakes，you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.51,1:46:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，according to Professor Sprout，they've still got a bit of growing up to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.72,1:46:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,But once their acne's cleared up，we'll be able to chop them up and stew them…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.50,1:47:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,and then we'll get those people down at the hospital un-Petrified.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.17,1:47:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,In the meantime，though，you three…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.30,1:47:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,had best be looking after yourselves。All right？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.26,1:47:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Neville.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.26,1:47:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，I don't know who did it，but you'd better come.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.22,1:47:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.32,1:47:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,It had to be a Gryffindor。Nobody else knows our password.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.38,1:47:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unless it wasn't a student.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.09,1:47:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoever it was，they must have been looking for something.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.59,1:48:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,And they found it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.75,1:48:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tom Riddle's diary is gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.39,1:48:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，listen up.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.27,1:48:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,We play our game，Hufflepuff doesn't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.13,1:48:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're stronger，quicker and smarter.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.52,1:48:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not to mention they're dead scared that Harry will Petrify them…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.29,1:48:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- if they fly anywhere near him。- Well，that too.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.87,1:48:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor McGonagall.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.84,1:48:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- This match has been canceled。- We can't cancel Quidditch.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.35,1:48:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Silence，Wood。You and your teammates will go to Gryffindor Tower。Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.91,1:48:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Potter，you and I will find Mr。Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.24,1:48:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's something the both of you have to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.59,1:48:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I warn you。This could be a wee bit of a shock.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.57,1:48:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.40,1:48:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,She was found near the library…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.20,1:48:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,along with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.61,1:48:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Does it mean anything to either of you？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.48,1:49:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.16,1:49:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could I have your attention，please？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.76,1:49:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because of recent events，these new rules will be put into effect immediately：
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.83,1:49:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,「All students will return to their house common rooms by 6：00 every evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.30,1:49:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,All students will be escorted to each lesson by a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.45,1:49:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,No exceptions。「
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.85,1:49:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should tell you this：
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.23,1:49:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unless the culprit behind these attacks is caught…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.05,1:49:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,it is likely the school will be closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.59,1:50:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've got to talk to Hagrid，Ron。I can't believe it's him…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.31,1:50:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,but if he did set the monster loose last time…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.41,1:50:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,he'll know how to get inside the Chamber of Secrets。That's a start.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.92,1:50:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you heard McGonagall.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.37,1:50:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're not allowed to leave the tower except for class.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.52,1:50:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think it's time to get my dad's old cloak out again.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.93,1:50:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah！- Ready？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.80,1:50:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's there？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.14,1:50:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？Hello？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.04,1:51:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's that for？- Nothing。I was expecting…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.72,1:51:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter。Come on in。I just made a pot of tea.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.12,1:51:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hagrid，are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.03,1:51:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm fine。I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.43,1:51:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you hear about Hermione？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.00,1:51:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。I heard about that，all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.01,1:51:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，we have to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.32,1:51:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know who's opened the Chamber of Secrets？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.14,1:51:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,What you had to understand about that is…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.24,1:51:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quick，under the cloak.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.64,1:51:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't say a word。Be quiet，both of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.56,1:51:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Professor Dumbledore，sir。- Good evening，Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.21,1:51:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wonder，could we…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.07,1:51:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course。Come in。Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.44,1:51:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's Dad's boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.13,1:52:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cornelius Fudge，Minister of Magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.70,1:52:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bad business，Hagrid，very bad business。Had to come.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.39,1:52:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three attacks on Muggle-borns。Things have gone far enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.96,1:52:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The Ministry's got to act。- But I never…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.27,1:52:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know I never，professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.33,1:52:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want it understood，Cornelius…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.22,1:52:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,that Hagrid…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.29,1:52:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,has my full confidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.68,1:52:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Albus，look，Hagrid's record is against him.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.18,1:52:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I've got to take him。- Take me？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.62,1:52:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take me where？Not Azkaban prison.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.31,1:52:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we have no choice，Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.38,1:52:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Already here，Fudge？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.56,1:52:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.38,1:52:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing here？Get out of my house！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.11,1:52:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Believe me…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.06,1:52:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,I take absolutely no pleasure being inside your…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.96,1:52:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,You call this a house？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.31,1:52:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.77,1:53:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I simply called up the school and was told the headmaster was here.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.58,1:53:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，what exactly is it that you want with me？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.28,1:53:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,The other governors and I have decided it's time for you to step aside.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.65,1:53:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is an order of suspension.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.07,1:53:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll find all 12 signatures on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.16,1:53:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we feel you've rather lost your touch.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.24,1:53:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，what，with all these attacks…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.84,1:53:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,there'll be no Muggle-borns left at Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.92,1:53:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can only imagine what an awful loss that would be to the school.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.42,1:53:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't take Professor Dumbledore away.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.20,1:53:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take him away and the Muggle-borns won't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.97,1:53:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You mark my words，there'll be killings next！
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.57,1:53:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think so？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.11,1:53:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Calm yourself，Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.65,1:53:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,If the governors desire my removal…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.08,1:54:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will，of course，step aside.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.34,1:54:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,However…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.24,1:54:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,you will find that help will always be given at Hogwarts…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.95,1:54:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,to those who…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.02,1:54:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,ask for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.16,1:54:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Admirable sentiments.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.66,1:54:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shall we？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.57,1:54:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fudge.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.69,1:54:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come，Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.57,1:54:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.02,1:54:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,If…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.48,1:54:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,If anybody was looking for some stuff…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.22,1:54:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,then all they'd have to do would be to follow the spiders.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.26,1:54:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yep。That would lead them right.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.03,1:55:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's all I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.70,1:55:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,And someone will need to feed Fang while I'm away.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.81,1:55:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.95,1:55:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hagrid's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.25,1:55:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,With Dumbledore gone，there'll be an attack a day.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.35,1:55:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.09,1:55:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.36,1:55:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Fang.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.92,1:55:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.45,1:56:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.92,1:56:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,You heard what Hagrid said。「Follow the spiders。」
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.33,1:56:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're heading to the Dark Forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.00,1:56:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why spiders？Why couldn't it be 「follow the butterflies」？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.25,1:56:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's something moving over there。Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.13,1:56:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It sounds like something big。- Big？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.60,1:57:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！Harry，it's our car！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.94,1:57:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,It must've been here all the time。And，look，the forest has turned it wild.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.94,1:57:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。We don't want to lose the trail.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.65,1:57:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.53,1:57:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harry，I don't like this at all。- Shush！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.07,1:57:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can we go back now？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.89,1:57:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.43,1:58:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is it？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:47.67,1:58:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.34,1:58:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hagrid？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.24,1:58:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that you？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.41,1:58:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're friends of Hagrid's.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.43,1:59:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you？You're Aragog，aren't you？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.26,1:59:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.73,1:59:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hagrid has never sent men into our hollow before.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.67,1:59:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's in trouble。Up at the school，there have been attacks.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:26.44,1:59:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,They think it's Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.54,1:59:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,They think he opened the Chamber of Secrets。Like before.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.38,1:59:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.90,1:59:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hagrid never opened the Chamber of Secrets.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.75,1:59:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Then you're not the monster？- No.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.79,1:59:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,The monster was born in the castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.99,1:59:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I came to Hagrid from a distant land in the pocket of a traveler.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.13,1:59:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harry。- Shh…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.47,1:59:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,But if you're not the monster，then what did kill that girl 50 years ago？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.21,2:00:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,We do not speak of it.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.35,2:00:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is an ancient creature we spiders fear above all others.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.28,2:00:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,But have you seen it？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.72,2:00:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never saw any part of the castle but the box in which Hagrid kept me.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.72,2:00:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,The girl was discovered in a bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.06,2:00:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I was accused，Hagrid brought me here.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.73,2:00:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harry！- What？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:39.61,2:00:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.55,2:00:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll just go.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.19,2:00:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.12,2:00:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think not.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.06,2:00:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,My sons and daughters do not harm Hagrid on my command.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.70,2:00:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I cannot deny them fresh meat…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.26,2:01:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,when it wanders so willingly into our midst.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.67,2:01:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goodbye，friend of Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.74,2:01:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can we panic now？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.29,2:01:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Know any spells？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:21.41,2:01:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,One，but it's not powerful enough for all of them.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:24.72,2:01:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's Hermione when you need her？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.97,2:01:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:47.41,2:01:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Arania Exumai！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:54.79,2:01:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.11,2:02:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.11,2:02:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Glad we're out of there.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.15,2:02:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Arania Exumai！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.19,2:02:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thanks for that。- Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.87,2:02:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.54,2:02:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:52.31,2:02:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Come on，move faster！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.25,2:03:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Go！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:17.99,2:03:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get us in the air.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:21.13,2:03:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,The flying gear's jammed！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:26.70,2:03:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on！Pull！- I'm trying！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.80,2:04:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Follow the spiders。Follow the spiders.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.90,2:04:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,If Hagrid ever gets out of Azkaban，I'll kill him.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.22,2:04:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，what was the point of sending us in there？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:24.63,2:04:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What have we found out？- We know one thing.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:29.40,2:04:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hagrid never opened the Chamber of Secrets.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:33.00,2:04:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was innocent.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:50.49,2:04:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wish you were here，Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.49,2:04:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need you.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:56.69,2:04:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now more than ever.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.71,2:05:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's that？- Ron…
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.95,2:05:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is why Hermione was in the library the day she was attacked.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.95,2:05:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:26.89,2:05:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Of the many fearsome beasts that roam our land…
Dialogue: 0,2:05:30.02,2:05:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,none is more deadly than the basilisk。Capable of living for hundreds of years…
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.83,2:05:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,instant death awaits any who meet this giant serpent's eye.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.67,2:05:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spiders flee before it。「 Ron，this is it.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.02,2:05:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,The monster in the Chamber of Secrets is a basilisk.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:44.91,2:05:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's why I can hear it speak。It's a snake.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.18,2:05:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,But if it kills by looking people in the eye，why is it no one's dead？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:05.09,2:06:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because no one did look it in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.96,2:06:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not directly，at least.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.80,2:06:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Colin saw it through his camera.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:16.20,2:06:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Justin…Justin must have seen the basilisk through Nearly Headless Nick.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.41,2:06:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nick got the full blast of it。But he's a ghost，he couldn't die again.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.58,2:06:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Hermione had the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:27.88,2:06:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I bet you she was using it to look around corners in case it came along.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.42,2:06:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Mrs。Norris？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.85,2:06:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure she didn't have a camera or a mirror，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.93,2:06:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,The water.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.26,2:06:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,There was water on the floor that night。She only saw the basilisk's reflection.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.97,2:06:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Spiders flee before it。」
Dialogue: 0,2:06:54.08,2:06:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It all fits。- But how's a basilisk been getting around？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:57.98,2:07:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,A dirty，great snake。Someone would have seen it.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:01.05,2:07:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hermione's answered that too。- Pipes？It's using the plumbing.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.82,2:07:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remember what Aragog said about that girl 50 years ago？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.26,2:07:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,She died in a bathroom？What if she never left？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:16.16,2:07:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Moaning Myrtle.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.47,2:07:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,All students are to return to their house dormitories at once.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:22.67,2:07:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,All teachers to the second-floor corridor immediately.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.11,2:07:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,As you can see，the Heir of Slytherin has left another message.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:37.12,2:07:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our worst fear has been realized.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.49,2:07:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,A student has been taken by the monster into the Chamber itself.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:45.13,2:07:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,The students must be sent home。I'm afraid this is the end of Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:53.17,2:07:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,So sorry。Dozed off。What have I missed？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.77,2:08:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,A girl has been snatched by the monster，Lockhart。Your moment has come at last.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:00.31,2:08:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- My moment？- Weren't you saying just last night…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.41,2:08:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,that you've known all along where the entrance to the Chamber of Secrets is？
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.32,2:08:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's settled。We'll leave you to deal with the monster，Gilderoy.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:14.96,2:08:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Your skills，after all，are legend。- Very well.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:20.33,2:08:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll just be in my office getting…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.37,2:08:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Getting ready.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:29.24,2:08:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is it that the monster's taken，Minerva？
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.61,2:08:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ginny Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:45.85,2:08:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Her skeleton will lie in the Chamber forever。」
Dialogue: 0,2:08:52.96,2:08:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ginny.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:56.83,2:09:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lockhart may be useless，but he's going to try and get into the Chamber.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.50,2:09:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,At least we can tell him what we know.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:04.57,2:09:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor，we have some information for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:08.91,2:09:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you going somewhere？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:11.05,2:09:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，yes。Urgent call。Unavoidable。Got to go.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:14.32,2:09:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What about my sister？- Well…
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.89,2:09:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,As to that，most unfortunate。No one regrets more than I.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.52,2:09:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're the Defense Against the Dark Arts teacher。You can't go now.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.69,2:09:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I must say，when I took the job，there was nothing in the description…
Dialogue: 0,2:09:28.86,2:09:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're running away？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:30.20,2:09:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- After all you did in your books？- Books can be misleading.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:33.17,2:09:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You wrote them。- My dear boy，do use your common sense.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:35.90,2:09:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,My books wouldn't have sold half as well if people didn't think I'd done those things.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.88,2:09:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a fraud.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:42.64,2:09:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've been taking credit for what other wizards have done.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:45.61,2:09:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there anything you can do？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:47.72,2:09:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，now you mention it。I'm rather gifted with Memory Charms.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:52.62,2:09:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Otherwise，all those wizards would have gone blabbing.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:55.29,2:09:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd never have sold another book.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:58.56,2:10:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,In fact，I'm going to have to do the same to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:04.80,2:10:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:18.45,2:10:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's there？
Dialogue: 0,2:10:22.32,2:10:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.29,2:10:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What do you want？- To ask you how you died.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:32.83,2:10:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was dreadful.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:35.43,2:10:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,It happened right here in this very cubicle.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:39.30,2:10:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd hidden because Olive Hornby was teasing me about my glasses.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:43.50,2:10:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was crying，and then I heard somebody come in.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.58,2:10:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who was it，Myrtle？- I don't know。I was distraught！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:56.22,2:10:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,But they said something funny，a kind of made-up language.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:59.79,2:11:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I realized it was a boy，so I unlocked the door to tell him to go away and…
Dialogue: 0,2:11:07.33,2:11:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I died。- Just like that？How？
Dialogue: 0,2:11:12.33,2:11:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just remember seeing a pair of great，big，yellow eyes…
Dialogue: 0,2:11:17.00,2:11:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,over there by that sink.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:45.93,2:11:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:48.87,2:11:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is it，Ron。I think this is the entrance to the Chamber of Secrets.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:55.68,2:12:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say something。Harry，say something in Parseltongue.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.07,2:12:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Excellent，Harry。- Good work。Well，then，I'll just be…
Dialogue: 0,2:12:56.34,2:12:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no need for me to stay.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:59.21,2:13:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，there is.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:02.91,2:13:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You first。- Now，boys，what good will it do？
Dialogue: 0,2:13:06.18,2:13:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Better you than us.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:08.72,2:13:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,But… Obviously，yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:15.92,2:13:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure you don't want to test it first？
Dialogue: 0,2:13:25.47,2:13:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's really quite filthy down here.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:29.17,2:13:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- All right。Let's go。- Oh，Harry？
Dialogue: 0,2:13:34.11,2:13:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you die down there，you're welcome to share my toilet.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:41.58,2:13:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，Myrtle.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:12.65,2:14:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，remember：Any sign of movement，close your eyes straightaway.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:18.79,2:14:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:24.16,2:14:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:32.53,2:14:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's this？- It looks like a snake.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:37.94,2:14:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's a snakeskin。- Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:41.78,2:14:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Whatever shed this must be 60 feet long。- Or more.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:49.48,2:14:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Heart of a lion，this one.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:56.16,2:15:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,The adventure ends here，boys。But don't fret.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:02.76,2:15:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,The world will know our story。How I was too late to save the girl.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:08.57,2:15:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,How you two tragically lost your minds…
Dialogue: 0,2:15:12.24,2:15:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,at the sight of her mangled body.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:16.08,2:15:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,So…
Dialogue: 0,2:15:18.65,2:15:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You first，Mr。Potter.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:21.22,2:15:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to your memories.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:26.45,2:15:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Obliviate！
Dialogue: 0,2:15:55.23,2:16:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry。Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:02.32,2:16:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ron！Ron，are you okay？- I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:09.20,2:16:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:11.63,2:16:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are you？
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.84,2:16:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ron Weasley。- Really？
Dialogue: 0,2:16:17.67,2:16:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,And who am I？
Dialogue: 0,2:16:22.31,2:16:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lockhart's Memory Charm backfired。He hasn't got a clue who he is.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:26.95,2:16:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's an odd sort of place，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,2:16:31.62,2:16:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you live here？
Dialogue: 0,2:16:34.46,2:16:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。- Really？
Dialogue: 0,2:16:41.56,2:16:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What do I do now？- You wait here…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:43.53,2:16:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,and try and shift some of this rock so we can get back through.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:46.63,2:16:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll go on and find Ginny。- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:14.25,2:18:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ginny！
Dialogue: 0,2:18:23.53,2:18:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ginny！Ginny，please don't be dead。Wake up，wake up.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:27.90,2:18:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please wake up.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:30.27,2:18:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,She won't wake.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:37.88,2:18:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tom。Tom Riddle。What do you mean，she won't wake？
Dialogue: 0,2:18:42.38,2:18:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She's not… - She's still alive，but only just.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:46.75,2:18:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are you a ghost？- A memory…
Dialogue: 0,2:18:49.22,2:18:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,preserved in a diary for 50 years.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:54.29,2:18:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's cold as ice。Ginny，please don't be dead。Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:59.67,2:19:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've got to help me，Tom。There's a basilisk.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:02.24,2:19:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,It won't come until it's called.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:07.64,2:19:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Give me my wand，Tom。- You won't be needing it.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:11.51,2:19:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We've got to go。We've got to save her。- I'm afraid I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:15.08,2:19:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，as poor Ginny grows weaker，I grow stronger.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:20.49,2:19:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，Harry，it was Ginny Weasley who opened the Chamber of Secrets.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:25.16,2:19:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。She couldn't。She wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:27.66,2:19:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was Ginny who set the basilisk on the Mudbloods and Filch's cat…
Dialogue: 0,2:19:31.03,2:19:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ginny who wrote the threatening messages on the walls.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:33.63,2:19:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But why？- Because I told her to.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:37.10,2:19:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll find I can be very persuasive。Not that she knew what she was doing.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:42.24,2:19:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,She was，shall we say，in a kind of trance.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:46.11,2:19:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still，the power of the diary began to scare her.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:48.78,2:19:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,She tried to dispose of it in the girls' bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:51.32,2:19:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then who should find it but you？
Dialogue: 0,2:19:55.86,2:19:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,The very person I was most anxious to meet.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:59.56,2:20:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,And why did you want to meet me？
Dialogue: 0,2:20:02.03,2:20:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew I had to talk to you，meet you if I could.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:05.57,2:20:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I decided to show you my capture of that brainless oaf Hagrid…
Dialogue: 0,2:20:09.00,2:20:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- to gain your trust。- Hagrid's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:13.11,2:20:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And you framed him，didn't you？- It was my word against Hagrid's.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:17.88,2:20:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only Dumbledore seemed to think he was innocent.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:21.32,2:20:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll bet Dumbledore saw right through you.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:23.65,2:20:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,He certainly kept an annoyingly close watch on me after that.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:27.29,2:20:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew it wouldn't be safe to open the Chamber again while I was still at school…
Dialogue: 0,2:20:30.76,2:20:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,so I decided to leave behind a diary…
Dialogue: 0,2:20:32.76,2:20:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,preserving my 16-year-old self in its pages…
Dialogue: 0,2:20:35.03,2:20:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,so that one day I would be able to lead another…
Dialogue: 0,2:20:37.90,2:20:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,to finish Salazar Slytherin's noble work.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:40.87,2:20:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you haven't finished it this time.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:43.30,2:20:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,In a few hours，the Mandrake Draught will be ready.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:46.44,2:20:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,And everyone who was Petrified will be all right again.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:49.58,2:20:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Haven't I told you？Killing Mudbloods doesn't matter to me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:55.08,2:20:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,For many months now，my new target has been you.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:01.32,2:21:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,How is it that a baby with no extraordinary magical talent…
Dialogue: 0,2:21:05.09,2:21:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,was able to defeat the greatest wizard of all time？
Dialogue: 0,2:21:08.10,2:21:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did you escape with nothing but a scar…
Dialogue: 0,2:21:11.20,2:21:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,while Lord Voldemort's powers were destroyed？
Dialogue: 0,2:21:13.77,2:21:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why do you care how I escaped？Voldemort was after your time.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:18.11,2:21:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Voldemort is my past，present and future.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:45.00,2:21:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,You。You're the Heir of Slytherin.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:51.61,2:21:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're Voldemort。- Surely you didn't think…
Dialogue: 0,2:21:55.38,2:21:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was going to keep my filthy Muggle father's name？
Dialogue: 0,2:22:00.05,2:22:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。I fashioned myself a new name，a name I knew wizards everywhere…
Dialogue: 0,2:22:04.38,2:22:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,would one day fear to speak when I became the greatest sorcerer in the world.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:08.76,2:22:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Albus Dumbledore is the greatest sorcerer in the world.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:12.09,2:22:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dumbledore's been driven out of this castle by the mere memory of me.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:15.66,2:22:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,He'll never be gone。Not as long as those who remain are loyal to him.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:27.14,2:22:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fawkes？
Dialogue: 0,2:22:44.42,2:22:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,So this is what Dumbledore sends his great defender.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:48.16,2:22:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,A songbird and an old hat.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:05.15,2:23:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's match the power of Lord Voldemort，Heir of Salazar Slytherin…
Dialogue: 0,2:23:09.85,2:23:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,against the famous Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:27.20,2:23:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Parseltongue won't save you now，Potter。It only obeys me.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:01.74,2:24:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,2:24:03.74,2:24:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your bird may have blinded the basilisk，but it can still hear you.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:50.24,2:25:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，Potter。The process is nearly complete.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:53.71,2:25:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,In a few minutes，Ginny Weasley will be dead，and I will cease to be a memory.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:58.79,2:26:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lord Voldemort will return…
Dialogue: 0,2:26:01.82,2:26:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,very much alive.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:06.76,2:26:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ginny？
Dialogue: 0,2:28:24.50,2:28:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remarkable，isn't it…
Dialogue: 0,2:28:26.27,2:28:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,how quickly the venom of the basilisk penetrates the body？
Dialogue: 0,2:28:30.44,2:28:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd guess you have little more than a minute to live.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:33.44,2:28:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll be with your dear Mudblood mother soon，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:42.48,2:28:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Funny，the damage a silly little book can do…
Dialogue: 0,2:28:46.32,2:28:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,especially in the hands of a silly little girl.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:54.23,2:28:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,2:28:58.87,2:29:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop。No！
Dialogue: 0,2:29:53.78,2:29:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ginny！
Dialogue: 0,2:29:57.45,2:29:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry
Dialogue: 0,2:29:59.29,2:30:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was me。But I swear，I didn't mean to.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:03.43,2:30:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Riddle made me，and…
Dialogue: 0,2:30:07.47,2:30:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，you're hurt.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:10.47,2:30:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:12.14,2:30:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ginny，you need to get yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:15.94,2:30:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Follow the Chamber and you'll find Ron.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:31.36,2:30:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were brilliant，Fawkes.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:34.59,2:30:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just wasn't quick enough.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:57.82,2:30:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:59.82,2:31:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Phoenix tears have healing powers.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:04.29,2:31:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:07.83,2:31:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right，Ginny.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:11.10,2:31:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:14.30,2:31:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just a memory.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:19.74,2:31:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Amazing！This is just like magic！
Dialogue: 0,2:31:36.36,2:31:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,You both realize，of course…
Dialogue: 0,2:31:39.19,2:31:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,that in the past few hours，you have broken perhaps a dozen school rules.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:45.37,2:31:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:46.53,2:31:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is sufficient evidence to have you both expelled.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:49.94,2:31:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:51.30,2:31:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Therefore，it is only fitting…
Dialogue: 0,2:31:55.61,2:31:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,that you both receive…
Dialogue: 0,2:31:58.38,2:32:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Special Awards for Services to the School.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:04.55,2:32:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:06.99,2:32:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，Mr。Weasley，if you would…
Dialogue: 0,2:32:09.46,2:32:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,have an owl deliver these release papers to Azkaban.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:14.73,2:32:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I believe we want our gamekeeper back.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:22.30,2:32:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:24.47,2:32:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,First，I want to thank you，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:29.44,2:32:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must have shown me real loyalty down in the Chamber.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:33.81,2:32:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing but that could have called Fawkes to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:40.79,2:32:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,And…
Dialogue: 0,2:32:42.89,2:32:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,second…
Dialogue: 0,2:32:44.49,2:32:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I sense that something is troubling you.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:49.50,2:32:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Am I right，Harry？
Dialogue: 0,2:32:53.83,2:32:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just…
Dialogue: 0,2:32:56.74,2:33:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，sir，I couldn't help but notice certain things，certain…
Dialogue: 0,2:33:01.64,2:33:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Certain similarities between Tom Riddle and me.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:07.85,2:33:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:09.22,2:33:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you can speak Parseltongue，Harry。Why？
Dialogue: 0,2:33:15.46,2:33:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because Lord Voldemort can speak Parseltongue.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:22.20,2:33:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I'm not mistaken，Harry…
Dialogue: 0,2:33:25.33,2:33:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,he transferred some of his powers to you…
Dialogue: 0,2:33:29.34,2:33:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,the night he gave you that scar.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:32.44,2:33:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Voldemort transferred some of his powers to me？
Dialogue: 0,2:33:38.24,2:33:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not intentionally…
Dialogue: 0,2:33:41.85,2:33:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,but yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:45.69,2:33:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,So the Sorting Hat was right。I should be in Slytherin.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:49.16,2:33:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's true。You possess many of the qualities that Voldemort himself prizes.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:54.16,2:33:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Determination，resourcefulness…
Dialogue: 0,2:33:57.20,2:34:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,and if I may say so，a certain disregard for the rules.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:01.87,2:34:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why，then，did the Sorting Hat place you in Gryffindor？
Dialogue: 0,2:34:06.67,2:34:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Because I asked it to。- Exactly，Harry。Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:10.54,2:34:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which makes you different from Voldemort.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:12.78,2:34:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is not our abilities that show what we truly are.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:16.95,2:34:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is our choices.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:22.76,2:34:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you want proof why you belong in Gryffindor…
Dialogue: 0,2:34:26.33,2:34:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,then I suggest you look more closely at this.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:32.20,2:34:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:39.54,2:34:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Godric Gryffindor.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:42.38,2:34:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,It would take a true Gryffindor to pull that out of the hat.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:55.36,2:34:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:58.02,2:35:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,So this is your master。The family you serve is the Malfoys.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:04.60,2:35:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll deal with you later.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:13.77,2:35:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Out of my way，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:15.54,2:35:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,So it's true。You have returned.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:19.81,2:35:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,When the governors learned that Arthur Weasley's daughter…
Dialogue: 0,2:35:22.75,2:35:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,was taken into the Chamber，they saw fit to summon me back.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:27.79,2:35:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ridiculous。- Curiously，Lucius，several of them…
Dialogue: 0,2:35:32.03,2:35:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,were under the impression that you would curse their family…
Dialogue: 0,2:35:35.86,2:35:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,if they did not agree to suspend me in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:39.17,2:35:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How dare you！- Beg your pardon？
Dialogue: 0,2:35:42.80,2:35:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,My sole concern has always been and will always be…
Dialogue: 0,2:35:46.74,2:35:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,the welfare of this school…
Dialogue: 0,2:35:49.74,2:35:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,and，of course，its students.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:58.08,2:36:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,The culprit has been identified，I presume？
Dialogue: 0,2:36:02.69,2:36:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:05.83,2:36:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,And？
Dialogue: 0,2:36:08.83,2:36:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who was it？
Dialogue: 0,2:36:17.27,2:36:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Voldemort.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:20.97,2:36:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only this time he chose to act through somebody else…
Dialogue: 0,2:36:26.98,2:36:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,by means of this.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:33.29,2:36:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:36.29,2:36:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fortunately，our young Mr。Potter discovered it.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:40.86,2:36:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,One hopes that no more of Lord Voldemort's old school-things…
Dialogue: 0,2:36:44.70,2:36:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,should find their way into innocent hands.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:48.27,2:36:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,The consequences for the one responsible would be…
Dialogue: 0,2:36:52.57,2:36:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,severe.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:55.84,2:36:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，let us hope…
Dialogue: 0,2:36:58.81,2:37:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,that Mr。Potter will always be around to save the day.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:05.12,2:37:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry。I will be.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:17.63,2:37:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:20.80,2:37:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come，Dobby。We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:41.62,2:37:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir？I wonder if I could have that？
Dialogue: 0,2:37:52.50,2:37:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:54.27,2:37:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Malfoy！
Dialogue: 0,2:37:56.94,2:37:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have something of yours.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:00.77,2:38:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mine？I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:03.94,2:38:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you do，sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:05.65,2:38:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you slipped the diary into Ginny Weasley's cauldron…
Dialogue: 0,2:38:08.92,2:38:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,that day at Diagon Alley.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:11.05,2:38:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You do，do you？
Dialogue: 0,2:38:20.96,2:38:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't you prove it？
Dialogue: 0,2:38:30.07,2:38:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come，Dobby.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:33.74,2:38:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open it.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:39.31,2:38:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:41.01,2:38:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Master has given Dobby a sock.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:44.45,2:38:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？I didn't give…
Dialogue: 0,2:38:46.72,2:38:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Master has presented Dobby with clothes.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:50.59,2:38:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby is free.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:00.20,2:39:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,You lost me my servant！
Dialogue: 0,2:39:10.91,2:39:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You shall not harm Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:27.06,2:39:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your parents were meddlesome fools too.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:30.93,2:39:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mark my words，Potter。One day soon…
Dialogue: 0,2:39:34.27,2:39:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,you are going to meet the same sticky end.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:45.18,2:39:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter freed Dobby。How can Dobby ever repay him？
Dialogue: 0,2:39:51.45,2:39:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Just promise me something。- Anything，sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:57.66,2:40:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never try to save my life again.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:06.27,2:40:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Welcome back，Sir Nicholas。- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:09.57,2:40:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good evening，Sir Nicholas。- Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:12.28,2:40:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good to see you，Sir Nicholas。- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:16.41,2:40:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:20.31,2:40:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hermione！Welcome back。- Thanks，Sir Nicholas.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:28.19,2:40:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry。It's Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:58.35,2:41:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Welcome back，Hermione。- It's good to be back.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:02.22,2:41:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Congratulations。I can't believe you solved it.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:04.99,2:41:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,We had loads of help from you.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:07.43,2:41:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We couldn't have done it without you。- Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:12.50,2:41:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could I have your attention，please？
Dialogue: 0,2:41:19.61,2:41:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Before we begin the feast…
Dialogue: 0,2:41:22.31,2:41:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,let us have a round of applause for Professor Sprout，Madam Pomfrey…
Dialogue: 0,2:41:28.71,2:41:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,whose Mandrake juice has been so successfully administered…
Dialogue: 0,2:41:33.02,2:41:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,to all who had been Petrified.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:46.20,2:41:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Also，in light of the recent events…
Dialogue: 0,2:41:49.37,2:41:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,as a school treat…
Dialogue: 0,2:41:51.70,2:41:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,all exams have been canceled.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:58.34,2:41:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:16.86,2:42:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:24.94,2:42:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,The owl that delivered my release papers got all lost and confused.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:29.63,2:42:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some ruddy bird called Errol.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:48.76,2:42:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I'd just like to say that if it hadn't been for you，Harry and Ron…
Dialogue: 0,2:42:54.93,2:42:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,and Hermione，of course…
Dialogue: 0,2:42:58.54,2:43:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I would still be you-know-where…
Dialogue: 0,2:43:02.81,2:43:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,so I'd just like to say thanks.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:15.37,2:43:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no Hogwarts without you，Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.28,0:00:30.02,Title,0,0,0,0,,《哈利波特与消失的密室》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.25,0:01:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能放你出来，海德薇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.49,0:01:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在校外，我是不能用魔法的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.42,0:01:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再说，弗农姨父 - 哈利·波特！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧你干的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.47,0:01:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在里边，弗农
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.61,0:01:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告你，你管不住那猫头鹰就让它滚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.95,0:01:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,可它闷得慌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.51,0:01:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能放它出来一两个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.19,0:01:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼，你就能给你那些怪胎小朋友送密信了，休想！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.32,0:01:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我一直都没有收到我朋友的任何讯息
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.63,0:01:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.70,0:02:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个暑假都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.33,0:02:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会跟你做朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.84,0:02:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你该懂得感恩图报
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.44,0:02:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从小把你养大，给你东西吃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.98,0:02:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至还把达力的小卧室也给你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.43,0:02:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直就是用尽一切心力对你好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.38,0:02:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还不可以，梅森先生来了才能吃 - 他们随时都会到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.79,0:02:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在呢，我们大家先来预习一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.79,0:02:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩妮，梅森夫妇到的时候，你会在…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.03,0:02:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在客厅里，准备用最亲切的态度欢迎他们光临
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.79,0:02:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好极了！达力，你会在… - 我会等着替他们开门
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.96,0:02:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.34,0:02:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.74,0:02:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会在我的房间里，不发出任何声音，假装没有我这个人存在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.28,0:02:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道就好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.18,0:02:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果运气好的话，我将会谈成这辈子最大的生意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.85,0:02:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝对不准出来给我搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.54,0:03:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特，真是太荣幸了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.24,0:03:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？ - 多比，家养小精灵多比
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.75,0:03:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我不懂礼貌
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.62,0:03:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是现在我卧室里真的不适合招待家养小精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.55,0:03:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 没关系，多比完全了解
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.22,0:03:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是多比有件事情一定要说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.49,0:03:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这…这实在是太难启齿了，多比不知道该怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.50,0:03:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要不要先坐下？ - 坐下… 坐…坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.57,0:03:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比…对不起，我不是故意要冒犯你的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒犯多比
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.58,0:03:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比听说你是个了不起的巫师
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.08,0:04:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但从来没有任何巫师平等对待多比，问多比要不要坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.79,0:04:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你一定是没有碰到好巫师
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.59,0:04:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是没有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.16,0:04:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我批评巫师是不对的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坏多比！坏多比 - 不要这样，多比，求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.07,0:04:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，别管那个，是只猫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.65,0:04:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坏多比 - 停下来，停下来，多比，求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.35,0:04:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.24,0:04:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比一定要惩罚他自己
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比差点就说了他家庭的坏话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.83,0:04:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的家庭？- 就是多比服侍的那个巫师家庭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.93,0:04:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比一辈子都得服侍同一个家庭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.10,0:04:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们知道多比在你这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.31,0:05:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是多比非来不可，多比必须保护哈利·波特，得警告他！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.24,0:05:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特今年绝对不能回到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.84,0:05:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨魔法学校去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.59,0:05:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个阴谋，一个会发生很恐怖的事的阴谋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.92,0:05:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么恐怖的事情？谁在计划这个阴谋？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.44,0:05:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，我不能说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.06,0:05:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好啦，我懂了，你不能说 - 不要叫我说，我…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.21,0:05:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多比，多比，不要这样 - 坏多比
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.77,0:05:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他们打到第九洞以后…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.02,0:05:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,把灯给我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.31,0:05:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比，放手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.16,0:05:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我进去，闭嘴，安静
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.33,0:05:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在这里搞什么东西啊？ - 我只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.56,0:05:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打断了我讲的日本人笑话最好笑的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.93,0:05:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.87,0:06:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再出一点声音，我保证让你死得很难看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.11,0:06:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把那门修好 - 是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在知道我为什么想回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.98,0:06:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不属于这里，我属于你们的世界，霍格沃茨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.92,0:06:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只有在那个地方才有朋友 - 那些都不写信给哈利·波特的朋友吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.73,0:06:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们可能是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.80,0:06:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，你怎么知道我的朋友没有写信给我？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.90,0:06:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特千万不能生多比的气
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.17,0:06:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比是想… 如果哈利·波特以为朋友都把他忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.42,0:06:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特就不会再想回学校去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.05,0:06:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把那些信给我，快 - 不！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.13,0:07:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比，快点回来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.60,0:07:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比 求求你，不要
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.32,0:07:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那哈利·波特必须保证说，他不会回学校去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.61,0:07:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能，霍格沃茨是我的家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.71,0:07:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那多比非这样做不可了，这全是为了哈利·波特好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.67,0:07:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家说怎么办呢，赶快叫那个水管工来吧，刚好来两个水管工
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.52,0:07:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个水管工说这边流出了水
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.86,0:07:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后第二个水管工就说没错，这只是最上面的水
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.17,0:07:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅森先生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.92,0:07:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗农告诉我，你是个很棒的高尔夫球员
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.64,0:07:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不过偶尔玩玩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.71,0:07:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.68,0:07:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅森太太
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这身漂亮的服装在哪里买的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.66,0:07:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，我的服装都是量身定做的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.53,0:08:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,达力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.21,0:08:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是有什么话想说？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.69,0:08:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布丁？- 布丁？什么布丁？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,真对不起，我这个外甥，他脑袋有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.20,0:08:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一看到陌生人就会发作，所以我才把他关在楼上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.41,0:08:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么，我们吃些冰淇淋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.06,0:08:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不准你再回那个学校去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.89,0:08:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不准你再去见你那些奇奇怪怪的朋友，永远不准！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.92,0:09:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.33,0:09:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩…弗雷德…乔治，你们来干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.17,0:09:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是来救你的啦，快去拿你的行李
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.83,0:09:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好往后站一点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.47,0:10:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始行动
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.34,0:10:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么声音？ - 什么声音？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.55,0:10:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸，怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.85,0:10:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，快
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸，快点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 快点，哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.13,0:10:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小子要逃跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.17,0:10:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利，快进来 - 你给我过来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放手 - 门都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.66,0:10:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟那只死鸽子哪儿都别想去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.57,0:10:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放开我 - 快开车
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.36,0:10:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 - 快开车
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.02,0:10:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！不！不！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.18,0:10:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.09,0:10:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.73,0:11:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了，哈利，生日快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.93,0:11:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.43,0:11:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点进来，嘘
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.17,0:11:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.61,0:11:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把这个拿走应该没关系吧 - 没错，妈不会知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.40,0:12:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是很大，但总是个家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.77,0:12:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这里很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.01,0:12:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们几个傢伙到底死到哪儿去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.28,0:12:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利能看到你真是太高兴了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.40,0:12:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,床上没人，没有留下任何纸条，偷开车子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.31,0:12:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有可能会死掉 你们有可能被别人看到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，我不是在说你，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.63,0:12:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们让哈利饿肚子 还把他窗户封起来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.09,0:12:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好也祷告我不会把你的窗户给封起来，罗恩·韦斯莱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.47,0:12:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，哈利，你该吃早餐了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.74,0:12:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快吃，哈利，别客气
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.76,0:12:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了，多吃一点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.74,0:12:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈 你有看到我的拖鞋吗？ - 亲爱的，就在猫的上面
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.85,0:12:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.85,0:13:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哪里做错了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.69,0:13:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是金妮，她整个夏天都在说你，真是烦死人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.46,0:13:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早啊，孩子们 - 早安，爸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.03,0:13:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 昨天晚上真累，九次突袭检查，九次 - 检查？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.36,0:13:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸在魔法部上班，他在禁止滥用麻瓜物品司
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.63,0:13:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最爱麻瓜了，最迷麻瓜的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.57,0:13:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃早餐了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.71,0:13:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.71,0:13:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，对不起，我叫做哈利，哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.69,0:13:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊，你真的是？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.12,0:13:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 罗恩跟我们提过你的事，他什么时候来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.11,0:13:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.73,0:13:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的儿子们半夜开着你那辆 迷人的车子出去把他载来的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.89,0:13:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？车子性能还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.38,0:13:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说，你们这么做实在太不对了，孩子们，简直不可原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，你一定很懂麻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.48,0:14:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我，那个橡皮鸭到底是做什么用的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.16,0:14:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是埃罗尔送信来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.63,0:14:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,珀西，你去拿信
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.77,0:14:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埃罗尔 - 埃罗尔每次都这样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.64,0:14:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是霍格沃茨寄来的信，他们也把哈利的信寄来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.17,0:14:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多一定知道哈利也在这儿，他还真神通广大
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.31,0:14:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 这些东西一点也不便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.40,0:14:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 光是咒语书就非常贵 - 我们会想办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.30,0:14:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个地方可以买到这些东西 对角巷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.66,0:14:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.32,0:14:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个给你，哈利，你先去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利从来没有用飞路粉旅行过，妈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.67,0:14:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞路粉？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.06,0:15:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你先去吧，让哈利看看该怎么用
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.77,0:15:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.21,0:15:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.21,0:15:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,对角巷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.95,0:15:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吗？ 很简单，不要害怕，来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.19,0:15:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.59,0:15:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进去，小心你的头
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.96,0:15:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样，抓一把飞路粉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.94,0:15:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了，就这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.04,0:15:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住，一定要讲得非常清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.71,0:15:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻倒巷（英文发音与对角巷相近）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.66,0:15:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他刚才说什么？ - 翻倒巷？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.44,0:15:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想也是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.04,0:17:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要碰任何东西，德拉科
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.92,0:17:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.12,0:17:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔福先生，您再次光临小店真是我的莫大的荣幸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.93,0:17:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常高兴小马尔福少爷也来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.27,0:17:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得让您们看看这个，今天才运到的，而且价钱非常的公道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.63,0:17:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我今天来可不是为了买东西的，博金先生，我是来卖东西的 - 卖东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.24,0:17:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉科
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.96,0:17:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该听说过吧，魔法部
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.76,0:17:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在对私人住宅进行突击搜查
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.00,0:18:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至有传言说新的麻瓜保护法要出台了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.40,0:18:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕有没有巫师血统越来越不重要了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.76,0:18:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不这样认为
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.09,0:18:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管如此，我从家里拿了几样东西过来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.31,0:18:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想让魔法部的人查出来没面子 只是毒药之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.71,0:18:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧这个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.04,0:18:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个特殊物品 不是拿来卖的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.39,0:18:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了 它有着独特的品质
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.76,0:18:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人不希望它落入坏人手中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以保留盒子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.20,0:18:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么跟你说的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.07,0:19:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要碰任何东西 - 知道就好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.00,0:19:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来，我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.72,0:19:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔福先生，很乐意与你做生意
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.24,0:19:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直很乐意
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.01,0:19:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在找什么 - 不，我…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.94,0:19:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是走错地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.01,0:19:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.93,0:19:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.15,0:20:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是不是迷路了？亲爱的 - 我没事，谢谢你，我只是要去…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.62,0:20:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我们来吧，我们会帮你找到回家的路
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.66,0:20:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不用了，谢谢 - 哈利？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.31,0:20:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.56,0:20:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会来这种地方？快过来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.20,0:20:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脏死了，哈利，偷偷在翻倒巷晃来晃去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.95,0:20:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里可不是好地方，希望没人看你在那儿，要不然大家会以为你在做坏事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.03,0:20:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是迷路了，我…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.22,0:20:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，那你又去那里做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.46,0:20:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我？喔，我是…嗯，我去找一种食肉鼻涕虫的杀虫剂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.92,0:20:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们快把学校的卷心菜吃光了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.46,0:20:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 海格
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.69,0:20:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，赫敏
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.63,0:21:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看到你真是太高兴了 - 我也很高兴看到你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.69,0:21:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的眼镜怎么那么脏？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.48,0:21:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,“恢复如初”
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.01,0:21:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得把这个咒语背起来才行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.72,0:21:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来你应该安全了，哈利 我就把你留在这儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.71,0:21:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好，再见 - 谢了，再见
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.46,0:21:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，大家都好担心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.43,0:21:24.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（神奇的我）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.90,0:21:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.29,0:21:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢老天爷，我们一直希望你只是去了比较远的壁炉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.88,0:21:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 我们欢迎吉德罗·洛哈特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.91,0:21:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.11,0:21:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈是他的粉丝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.91,0:21:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦请让一让，太太，借过一下，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.44,0:21:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，不好意思，小朋友，这是为预言家日报拍的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.19,0:22:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这该不会是哈利·波特吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.21,0:22:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.43,0:22:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.63,0:22:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑容大一点，哈利，我们的合照将会登上头版
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.35,0:22:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位女士，各位先生，这真是不平凡的一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.14,0:22:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特，今天早上特地踏进了…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.61,0:22:22.20,Title,0,0,0,0,,丽痕书店，来购买我的自传《神奇的我》
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.18,0:22:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这本书最近刚好登上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.22,0:22:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,预言家日报畅销书排行榜第27周的榜首
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.22,0:22:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利绝对不会想到，他也不会相信
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.76,0:22:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将会得到我的全套著作
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.40,0:22:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全免费
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.77,0:22:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,签名会开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.27,0:22:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，我帮你拿，我要给他签名
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.51,0:22:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都到外头去等我吧，快
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.11,0:23:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你一定很过瘾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.83,0:23:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,出名的哈利·波特，连到书店都会登上报纸头版
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.96,0:23:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你少来烦他
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.07,0:23:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得了，波特，你有新女友了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.74,0:23:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样，德拉科，亲切一点
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.86,0:23:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.69,0:23:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是卢修斯·马尔福，我们终于见面了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.98,0:23:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.42,0:23:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的疤痕可是个传奇
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.05,0:23:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是某个巫师留给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.76,0:23:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏地魔杀了我的父母
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.91,0:23:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不过是个杀人犯，没什么了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.13,0:23:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢直呼他的名字不是特别大胆
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.95,0:23:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是特别蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.68,0:24:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不敢直呼对方的名字，只会更加深你的恐惧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.78,0:24:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该是 格兰杰小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.00,0:24:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，德拉科跟我提过你的事，还有你的父母
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.71,0:24:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是麻瓜，不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.33,0:24:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想想 红头发，一脸痴呆
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.80,0:24:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 肮脏的二手书
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.52,0:24:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们应该就是韦斯莱一家了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.13,0:24:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们，这里有点乱，我们出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.70,0:24:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哎哎哎，老韦斯莱 - 卢修斯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.20,0:24:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在魔法部一定很忙吧，那么多突击检查
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.19,0:24:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望他们有付你加班费
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.52,0:24:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但照你们目前的样子来看，他们应该是没有
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.66,0:24:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又何苦侮辱巫师名声呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.48,0:25:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是魔法部 连像样的薪水都付不出来的话
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.94,0:25:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为我们 在侮辱巫师名声这件事上有不同的看法，马尔福
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.09,0:25:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.81,0:25:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟那些麻瓜往来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.99,0:25:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你家真是堕落到了极点
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.69,0:25:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上班见了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.57,0:25:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们学校见了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.01,0:25:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 10点58分了，快点 - 快点 列车快开了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.07,0:25:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷德，乔治，珀西，你们先
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.76,0:25:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.01,0:26:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先，亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.34,0:26:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，金妮，快去找座位，快
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.84,0:26:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,该我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.86,0:26:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们俩在干什么？ - 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.34,0:26:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有点控制不住推车
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.73,0:26:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么我们过不去？ - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.30,0:26:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道入口为什么被封起来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.94,0:26:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,列车在11点就会准时开走 我们会错过列车
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.92,0:26:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，如果我们过不去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.63,0:26:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸跟妈可能也出不来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.30,0:26:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们应该回到车子旁边去等
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.95,0:27:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,车子？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.23,0:27:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.69,0:27:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们必须找到霍格沃茨特快列车
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.44,0:27:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩，你确定会飞这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.17,0:27:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.37,0:27:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.56,0:27:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.64,0:27:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩，我必须提醒你
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.98,0:27:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部份麻瓜都没有看见过会飞的车子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.23,0:27:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，对喔
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.35,0:27:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.63,0:28:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，糟了，一定是隐形发射器故障了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.18,0:28:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么这样，我们飞低一点，我们要赶快找到列车
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.71,0:28:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.03,0:28:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只要追上列车就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.00,0:28:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不会太远
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.79,0:28:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你听到了吗？ - 我们快要赶上了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.75,0:28:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.87,0:28:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.16,0:29:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧点
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.79,0:29:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.11,0:29:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑着点
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.51,0:29:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在努力，你的手心都是汗水
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.69,0:29:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们找到列车了 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.20,0:29:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.84,0:30:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,往上
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.17,0:30:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.34,0:30:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩小心那棵树
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.18,0:30:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快停
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.63,0:30:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的魔杖，你看我的魔杖 - 你该庆幸那不是你的脖子
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.24,0:30:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.28,0:31:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快发动车子，快
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.19,0:32:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,斑斑，你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.39,0:32:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,车子
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.87,0:32:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸一定会宰了我
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.28,0:32:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会见，海德薇
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.95,0:32:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的房里出现了个家养小精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.50,0:32:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们无法进入九又四分之三月台
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.49,0:32:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后又差点被一棵树给打死
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.00,0:32:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显地有人不想我回到学校
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.14,0:33:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，看看你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.24,0:33:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能是 你们最后一次待在这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.98,0:33:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的麻烦大了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.75,0:33:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少有七个麻瓜看到你们
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.39,0:33:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可知道这件事有多严重
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.86,0:33:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们差一点就让我们的世界被公诸于世
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.36,0:33:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别说你们还造成打人柳严重的损害
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.52,0:33:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这棵树可比你们的年纪还要大
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.07,0:33:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说，斯内普教授，打人柳对我们的伤害更大
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.75,0:33:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,住口
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.98,0:33:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你们保证，如果你们是斯莱特林的学生 而且我有权力决定你们的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.52,0:33:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个保证今晚就得搭列车回家
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.49,0:33:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而且永远… - 他们不用回家
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.93,0:33:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多教授，麦格教授
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.36,0:34:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,校长
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.03,0:34:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两个孩子他们的所做所为 藐视了未成年巫师限制法令，基于我是本校
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.11,0:34:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白，我很明白所有的法规
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.08,0:34:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中很多条款都是我制定的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.31,0:34:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是，基于麦格教授才是…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.72,0:34:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰芬多的学院领导人，因此她才有权决定如何处罚
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.19,0:34:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上去收拾行李
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.52,0:34:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？韦斯莱
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.13,0:34:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是要开除我们吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.90,0:34:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天还不用，韦斯莱同学
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.20,0:34:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我必须让你们两个人记住你们犯下了多么严重的错误
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.74,0:34:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天晚上我就写信通知你们的家人 还要罚你们两个留校劳动
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.46,0:34:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我提议大家都回到宴会上去
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.46,0:34:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有我最爱吃的美味可口的蛋塔
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.27,0:35:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,费尔奇先生，你掉了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.98,0:35:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位同学早
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.38,0:35:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 各位同学早 - 斯普劳特教授，早
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.94,0:35:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎各位二年级同学来到三号温室，现在大家靠过来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.44,0:35:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天要替曼德拉草换盆
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.51,0:36:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有谁可以告诉我曼德拉草的根有什么用途？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.32,0:36:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰杰同学请说
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.49,0:36:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼德拉草，又名茄参（魔苹果）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.19,0:36:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常是用来帮助被石化的人，使他们能够恢复原形
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.17,0:36:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,它也具有相当的危险性，听到曼德拉草的哭声有可能致命
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.49,0:36:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了，格兰芬多加十分
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.38,0:36:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的曼德拉草现还只是幼苗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.41,0:36:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们的哭声还不足以致命
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.34,0:36:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还时能让你们昏迷几个小时，所以我才分这些耳罩给你们，
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.42,0:36:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可以挡住曼德拉草的哭声
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.24,0:36:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在请大家戴上耳罩，请快点
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.49,0:36:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧紧的盖住，大家仔细的看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.74,0:36:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,先紧紧的抓住曼德拉草
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.98,0:36:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后用力的把它从土里拉出来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.95,0:36:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.98,0:36:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它埋到另外一个盆子里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.53,0:36:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再洒上一撮土壤，让它保持温暖这样就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.72,0:37:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,隆巴顿同学忘了他的耳罩了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.33,0:37:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是，教授，他只是昏倒了 - 没错，别管他了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.85,0:37:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，现在我们要帮曼德拉草换盆
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.58,0:37:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住你们的曼德拉草，用力拉出来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.06,0:37:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是差点没头的尼克 - 你好珀西，清水小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.11,0:37:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，尼克爵士
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.96,0:37:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说吧 我完了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.19,0:37:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你完了 - 嗨，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.36,0:38:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是科林·克里维，我也念格兰芬多
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.27,0:38:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨，科林，很高兴认识你 - 嘿，你说你的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.24,0:38:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不可以帮忙照一张相 我站在你旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.68,0:38:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明我确实见到你了 这是为了我爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.34,0:38:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个送奶的 除我之外，我爸和家里其他人都不会魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.33,0:38:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在收到霍格沃茨的录取通知以前，我从来都不知道魔法能干这么多事情
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.01,0:38:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 每个人都认为我是幻想罢了 - 我理解
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.80,0:38:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩，那是你的猫头鹰吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.23,0:38:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只鸟真是太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.11,0:38:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.87,0:38:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家快看，罗恩收到一封吼叫信
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.16,0:38:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看吧，罗恩，我有次不理我奶奶的吼叫信，后果好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.41,0:39:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩·韦斯莱
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.99,0:39:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟敢偷偷的开走那辆车，你的行为真是可耻
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.26,0:39:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲现在得接受工作单位的调查
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.22,0:39:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这全都是你的错
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.99,0:39:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是敢再犯任何的错误
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.02,0:39:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上去带你回来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.74,0:39:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，亲爱的金妮，恭喜你进了格兰芬多
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.54,0:39:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸跟我都以你为傲
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.52,0:40:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在让我为大家介绍，你们的黑魔法防御课新教授
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.95,0:40:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是… 我
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.72,0:40:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉德罗·洛哈特
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.36,0:40:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅林勋章的…第三级巫师
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.77,0:40:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑魔法防御术联盟最崇高的…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.50,0:40:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣誉会员
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.51,0:40:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时也是女巫周刊迷人笑容奖五次冠军得主
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.78,0:40:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不想提这些事情
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.64,0:40:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是靠着我的迷人笑容来除妖的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.37,0:40:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们买了我的全套书了，这很好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.37,0:40:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我就给大家来个小测验
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.89,0:40:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.01,0:40:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次测验只是想看看大家理解了多少书本的内容
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.65,0:40:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.57,0:40:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经读了多少
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.65,0:41:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这些问题，全部是关于他的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.45,0:41:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉德罗·洛哈特喜爱什么颜色？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.33,0:41:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉德罗·洛哈特至今最大的成就是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.41,0:41:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有三十分钟的答题时间，现在开始…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.05,0:41:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.61,0:41:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们几乎没人记得我喜爱的颜色是淡紫色
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.09,0:41:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏·格兰杰小姐除外…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.01,0:41:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我的最大心愿是扫除世界上的恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.31,0:41:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功推广我的护发药水系列 好姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.46,0:41:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，请注意
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.75,0:41:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的职责就是教大家如何…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.90,0:41:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对付魔法世界最恶心的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.72,0:42:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们马上就会在教室中面对最深的恐惧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.71,0:42:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是只要有我在这里，你们就会安然无恙
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.03,0:42:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要请大家千万不要尖叫
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.01,0:42:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样会激怒他们的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.21,0:42:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,康沃尔郡小精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.96,0:42:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚被逮到的康沃尔郡小精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.78,0:42:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量的笑吧，西莫同学
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.22,0:42:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,小精灵他可是非常难缠的小恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.55,0:42:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,来看看你们该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.79,0:42:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家快点动手，快点，他们不过是小精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.85,0:42:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呆在这！- 拜托，快放我下来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.29,0:43:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放开我 - 那里，别动
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.39,0:43:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,[回笼咒] 佩斯奇皮克西 佩斯特诺米
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.58,0:43:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你们机会，把剩下小精灵抓回笼子里面
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.15,0:43:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.04,0:43:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,“谁也不许动”
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.93,0:43:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么每次都是我？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.57,0:44:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我整个暑假都在设计 全新的魁地奇训练计划
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.65,0:44:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的训练必须更早更严更久
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.44,0:44:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.34,0:44:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们要去哪里？弗林特 - 魁地奇场
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.43,0:44:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我已经登记包下今天的球场了 - 别激动，我得到了许可
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.95,0:44:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像有麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.01,0:44:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我，斯内普教授特别允许斯莱特林球队
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.87,0:44:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在今日使用魁地奇球场让他们训练新的找球手
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.39,0:44:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有新找球手了，谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.72,0:44:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马尔福 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.52,0:44:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不算是最新的一份子
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.07,0:44:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是光轮两千零一号 你们怎么会有这个？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.04,0:44:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是马尔福的父亲送的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.17,0:44:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯莱，这对我父亲来说，只是花点小钱而已
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.24,0:44:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少格兰芬多的队员都是凭真本事
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.36,0:44:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是靠钱才入选的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.17,0:45:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人问你的意见，你这肮脏的泥巴种
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.68,0:45:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要为你说的话付出代价，马尔福，看招
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.62,0:45:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.40,0:45:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说话
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.69,0:45:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇！可不可以把他转过来，不行 - 快让开
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.04,0:45:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带他去找海格
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.39,0:45:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定知道该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.62,0:45:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这得用特别的设备才行
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.76,0:46:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕只能等他自己停止吐了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.71,0:46:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好啦 - 出来总比进去好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.51,0:46:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗恩到底要对谁下咒？ - 是马尔福 他叫赫敏…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.76,0:46:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不懂那是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.40,0:46:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫我泥巴种
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.82,0:46:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会吧 - 泥巴种是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.92,0:46:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是肮脏的血统，是对出自麻瓜家庭的人最不敬的称呼
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.68,0:46:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是父母不懂魔法，像我这样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.46,0:46:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种话在有教养的对话中是听不到的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.60,0:46:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道了吧，哈利，有些巫师，就像马尔福他们家
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.63,0:46:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,自认为自己是血统纯正，充满了优越感
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.28,0:46:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.08,0:46:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.54,0:47:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那简直是一派胡言，肮脏的血统
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.36,0:47:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在世上的巫师，多多少少都有一点混血
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.93,0:47:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,更何况，还没有哪个巫师能发明出赫敏学不会的魔咒
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.24,0:47:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.07,0:47:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不这么想吗？赫敏，你从来没有这样想过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.79,0:47:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.93,0:47:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己想一想
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.56,0:47:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事… 比帮我回信
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.38,0:47:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要更好的处罚方式
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.29,0:47:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是没有
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.89,0:47:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,名气是不可靠的朋友，名人来自于名人的作为
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.05,0:47:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.48,0:47:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.81,0:47:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.18,0:48:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,到我这来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.84,0:48:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.64,0:48:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个声音
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.87,0:48:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.01,0:48:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没有听到吗？ - 你在说什么？哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.23,0:48:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你大概是有一点困了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.79,0:48:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪不得，看看现在几点了，已经过了四个钟头了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.36,0:48:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢乐的时光总是过得特别的快
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.38,0:48:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好怪
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.46,0:48:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,血
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.67,0:48:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我闻到鲜血
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.31,0:48:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要撕裂你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.74,0:48:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.14,0:48:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.54,0:49:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.58,0:49:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀了你 - 哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.68,0:49:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有没有听到？ - 听到什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.32,0:49:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个声音 - 什么声音？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.71,0:49:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚在洛哈特的办公室听到，然后刚刚又…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.94,0:49:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀戮时间到了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.34,0:49:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,声音在移动，我想他要去杀人了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.60,0:49:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀人？- 哈利，等等，别跑那么快！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.62,0:49:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.73,0:49:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我从来没有看过蜘蛛这样跑的 - 我最讨厌蜘蛛了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.97,0:50:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.84,0:50:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,密室已经打开 继承人的仇敌们，当心了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.29,0:50:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是用血写的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.49,0:50:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.44,0:50:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是费尔奇的猫
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.24,0:50:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛丽斯太太
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.22,0:50:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,继承人的仇敌，当心了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.77,0:50:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是下一个，泥巴种
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.30,0:50:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在这里做什么？ 快点，让开
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.78,0:51:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.88,0:51:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.32,0:51:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛丽斯太太
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.20,0:51:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你竟然杀了我的猫 - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.67,0:51:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.30,0:51:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要杀了你 - 费尔奇
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.52,0:51:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要冲动
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.82,0:51:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的人马上回到自己的宿舍去，不准出来
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.08,0:51:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.71,0:51:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们三个
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.99,0:51:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉文克劳的同学跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.81,0:51:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没有死，费尔奇，她只是被石化了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.01,0:51:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，我就知道，真可惜我不在现场
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.11,0:51:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚好知道拯救她的解咒术
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.44,0:51:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 我不知道她是怎么被石化的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.42,0:52:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,问他，都是他干的好事
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.27,0:52:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到他在墙上写的字了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.01,0:52:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我，校长，我发誓，我根本没碰过洛丽斯太太
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.47,0:52:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 胡说八道 - 依我看，校长
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.29,0:52:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许波特和他的朋友们 是刚好在这里出现
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.65,0:52:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.69,0:52:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这整件事情实在太可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.07,0:52:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得晚上大家用餐时候有看过波特
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.83,0:52:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在我那里，斯内普
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.16,0:52:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利他在帮我回信给我的粉丝
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.56,0:52:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我跟罗恩才会去找哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.43,0:52:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们碰到他的时候，他说
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.43,0:52:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说，说了什么？ - 我告诉他们我很饿
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.28,0:52:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我们一起回公共休息室的时候，看到了洛丽斯太太
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.80,0:53:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在证明有罪之前，他是无辜的 - 我的猫被石化了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.11,0:53:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要见到有人被惩罚 - 我们会治好她的，费尔奇
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.87,0:53:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据我的了解，斯普劳特夫人培育出了非常健康的曼德拉草
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.95,0:53:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,等它们成熟后制造出解药，就可以让洛丽斯太太复原了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.66,0:53:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这段期间
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.94,0:53:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议大家最好都谨慎行事
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.78,0:53:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万记住
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.79,0:53:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这真的很奇怪，对不对？ - 奇怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.29,0:53:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了这个声音，只有你才能听得到
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.33,0:53:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后洛丽斯太太就被石化了，这真的很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.20,0:53:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想我要不要告诉他们，告诉邓布利多和其他的人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.48,0:53:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯啦
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.10,0:54:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行，哈利，即使在巫师的世界，听见怪声音也不是好现象
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.78,0:54:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得很有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.14,0:54:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位同学请听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.23,0:54:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，今天呢 我们要把动物
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.63,0:54:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成高脚杯
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.18,0:54:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像这样
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.01,0:54:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一，二，三，沸啦唯杜
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.50,0:54:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在换你们了，谁要先来示范呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.70,0:54:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃，韦斯莱同学 一，二，三 沸啦唯杜
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.36,0:54:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,沸啦瓦杜
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.73,0:54:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该换一把魔杖了，韦斯莱同学
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.62,0:54:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么事？格兰杰 - 教授，不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.73,0:55:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能告诉我们 关于密室的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.52,0:55:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.18,0:55:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想大家都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.48,0:55:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨是在一千多年前
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.53,0:55:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,由当时最伟大的四位 巫师跟女巫创办的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.22,0:55:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈德里克·格兰芬多，赫尔加·赫夫帕夫
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.16,0:55:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊纳·拉文克劳，以及萨拉查·斯莱特林
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.09,0:55:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中的三位创办者呢，他们相处的十分融洽
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.52,0:55:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有一位则不是 - 想也知道是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.15,0:55:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯莱特林
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.78,0:55:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望能够进一步的筛选获准入学的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.27,0:55:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他相信，只有魔法家庭的子弟，才能学习魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.02,0:55:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说要血统纯正
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.54,0:56:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他因为无法说服其他人，因此离开了这所学校
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.70,0:56:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,而根据传说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.20,0:56:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯莱特林在城堡中，建了一个秘密的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.94,0:56:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都把这个房间称为密室
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.56,0:56:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在他离开学校之前，他封住了密室
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.37,0:56:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到他真正的继承人回到了学校
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.61,0:56:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个继承人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.02,0:56:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会打开那个密室
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.93,0:56:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,释放出里面恐怖的东西，到那个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.00,0:56:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,便能除掉学校中所有的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.41,0:56:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯莱特林认为 没有资格学习魔法的人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.10,0:56:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻瓜的后代
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.18,0:56:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，学校人员进行过好几次的搜寻
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.85,0:56:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这样的密室并没有找到
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.06,0:56:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦格教授，传说有没有告诉我们 密室中的东西是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.67,0:57:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说密室中的那个东西
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.43,0:57:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯有斯莱特林的后人才能掌控
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.64,0:57:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说 里面住了一个
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.38,0:57:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怕的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.61,0:57:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会是真的吗？ 你们想真的有所谓的密室吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.70,0:57:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有，你看不出来吗？ 麦格教授很担心，所有的教授也是
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.04,0:57:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果有所谓的密室，而且密室也被打开了，那不就表示
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.05,0:57:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯莱特林的继承人已经回到了学校 问题在于 他是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.29,0:57:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家想想看，我们认识的人里，有谁把麻瓜后代看成人渣
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.73,0:57:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果你是说马尔福的话 - 当然，你也听到他的话了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.55,0:57:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是下一个泥巴种
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.12,0:57:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了，可是马尔福 斯莱特林的继承人？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.21,0:57:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许罗恩说得没错，赫敏，你看他的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.56,0:57:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们家人几百年来都是斯莱特林的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.53,0:57:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉克跟高尔一定知道，或许我们可以向他们套一些话
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.29,0:57:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还没笨到那种程度，或许还有别的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.67,0:58:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我提醒你们，这方法很困难
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.81,0:58:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们至少得违反五十条校规
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.95,0:58:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这方法很危险，十分的危险
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.39,0:58:09.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（超强魔药）
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.03,0:58:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了 变身水
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.88,0:58:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要作出正确的调配，这种魔药就可以让喝下的人暂时的完全变成
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.82,0:58:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外一个人的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.04,0:58:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说哈利跟我喝下那个东西就会变成克拉克与高尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.28,0:58:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对！马尔福肯定会说出一切 - 没有错
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.76,0:58:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这药很难做，我从来没见过这么复杂的配方
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.75,0:58:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那要多久才能配好？ - 一个月
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.16,0:58:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,要一个月
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.88,0:58:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是，赫敏，如果马尔福是斯莱特林的继承人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.96,0:58:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个月以内，他至少 可以攻击一半以上的麻瓜后代
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.33,0:58:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.23,0:58:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们只有这个方法
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.92,0:59:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯莱特林再得分
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.96,0:59:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,以九十比三十领先格兰芬多
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.53,0:59:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.36,0:59:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.17,1:00:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意了，大疤头
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.83,1:00:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.73,1:00:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,伍德，小心
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.54,1:01:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩，脾气暴躁的游走球盯住哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.54,1:01:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直是太过分了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.06,1:01:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要阻止它 - 不行
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.46,1:01:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你的魔杖没坏掉都很危险了，你要相信哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.60,1:01:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在跳芭雷舞，波特
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.04,1:02:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你追不上我的，波特
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.99,1:03:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,快过去
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.43,1:03:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特捕到了金色飞贼，格兰芬多获胜
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.98,1:04:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,“粉身碎骨”
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.44,1:04:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.59,1:04:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好，我想 我的胳膊断掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.54,1:04:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心，哈利，我马上就可以帮你把手臂医好
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.15,1:04:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不，你不必了 - 喔，可怜，已经语无伦次了，来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.64,1:04:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心，一点都不会痛
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.80,1:04:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,“胳膊胳膊修”
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.29,1:04:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，没错，呃，有的时候会是这样没错
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.57,1:04:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过呢 重点是
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.20,1:04:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再也不会痛了，而且你的手臂再也不会骨折了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.38,1:04:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,骨折？ 他连骨头都没了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.57,1:05:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是弹性蛮好的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.90,1:05:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 别再叫了，你可以出院了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.71,1:05:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开 你们要是直接送来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.71,1:05:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就能修好骨头，现在要让骨头长回来就难了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.40,1:05:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能治好他吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.91,1:05:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然可以治好他啰，会有点疼就是了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.68,1:05:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天晚上会不太好受，重新长骨头不是件舒服的事
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.99,1:05:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早该知道这不会好喝的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.17,1:05:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀戮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.77,1:05:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀戮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.68,1:05:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀戮时间
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.71,1:05:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.26,1:05:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.83,1:06:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特应该听多比的话
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.56,1:06:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特赶不上火车的时候就该回家了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.48,1:06:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你！是你封住月台，让我跟罗恩没办法过去
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.49,1:06:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说，没错
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.64,1:06:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你差点害我跟罗恩被开除 - 至少这样能让你离开这里
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.32,1:06:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特必须回家
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.22,1:06:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比以为他的游走球可以让哈利·波特明白
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.45,1:06:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的游走球，是你让游走球拼命追我的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.56,1:06:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比真的觉得很难过
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.23,1:06:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比还用熨斗烫他自己的手
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.04,1:06:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好在我骨头长出前说清楚，否则我一定会掐死你
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.32,1:06:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比已经习惯这样的威胁了 多比在家里，一天至少要被威胁五次
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.18,1:06:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你是不打算告诉我你为什么要杀我啰？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.03,1:06:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是要杀你，我不会杀你的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.96,1:07:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比还记得哈利·波特打败
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.82,1:07:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能说出名字的那个人前
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.09,1:07:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们过着什么样的生活，我们家养小精灵的生活简直是猪狗不如
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.96,1:07:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然多比现在的生活还是猪狗不如
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.26,1:07:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要穿那种东西？多比
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.08,1:07:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个吗？这是家养小精灵的奴隶标志
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.39,1:07:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有主人送衣服给多比时，多比才能自由
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.27,1:07:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.14,1:07:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.92,1:07:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨即将发生恐怖的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.29,1:07:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特绝对不可以留在这个地方
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.20,1:07:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为历史就要重演了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.87,1:07:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史重演？你是说以前也发生过这些事
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.47,1:07:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不应该说这些的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.19,1:08:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坏多比 - 多比
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.56,1:08:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样，多比
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.06,1:08:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我，多比，以前什么时候发生过？是谁在主使？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.83,1:08:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比不能说，多比只希望哈利·波特能够平安
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.09,1:08:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，多比，告诉我 到底是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.91,1:08:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他放这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.48,1:08:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事了？ - 又发生了攻击事件
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.76,1:08:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为他应该是被石化了，庞弗雷夫人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.33,1:08:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许 科林是正要给攻击者照相吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.04,1:09:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事，校长？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.08,1:09:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这表示
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.23,1:09:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的学生面临极大的危险
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.16,1:09:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我该怎么告诉其他人？ - 说实话
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.90,1:09:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们霍格沃茨 已经不再安全了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.00,1:09:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就如同我们所害怕的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.01,1:09:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,学校的密室已经再度被打开了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.61,1:09:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,再度？你是说 密室以前曾经被打开过
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.87,1:09:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 你还不懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.78,1:09:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是马尔福他爸爸，在这里读书的时候打开的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.37,1:09:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后他又教马尔福怎么开 - 大概吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.31,1:09:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等变身水完成后我们就可以得到确认了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.50,1:09:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能告诉我，为什么 我们要在大白天熬制变身水？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.69,1:09:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还在女厕所里面制作，你不怕被抓吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.63,1:09:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的，不会有人进来这里
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.99,1:10:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？ - 哭泣的桃金娘
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.71,1:10:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.09,1:10:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哭泣的桃金娘
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.20,1:10:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁是哭泣的桃金娘？ - 我就是哭泣的桃金娘
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.25,1:10:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不期待你听过我
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.97,1:10:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会谈论那个又丑
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.96,1:10:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,又悲惨，又痛苦的哭泣的桃金娘
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.49,1:10:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有点多愁善感
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.17,1:10:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家过来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.55,1:10:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，过来，大家都看得到我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.53,1:10:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都 听得见吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.34,1:10:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.42,1:10:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为最近这几周所发生的可怕事件
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.49,1:10:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多教授特许我成立这个小小的决斗俱乐部
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.99,1:11:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我训练大家，等有需要的时候，各位就能保护自己了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.16,1:11:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我以前做过的无数次自我防御
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.77,1:11:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道细节，请参考我所有的著作
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.75,1:11:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 洛哈特很了不起，对不对？ - 很勇敢的男子汉
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.96,1:11:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫贾斯廷·芬列里 - 赫夫帕夫学院的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.15,1:11:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你，我叫…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.75,1:11:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁，即使我们麻瓜出身的人也都认识你
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.79,1:11:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我为各位介绍 我的助手
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.03,1:11:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯内普教授
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.80,1:11:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他愿意冒险来为我做一场小小的示范
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.60,1:11:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想你们这些孩子担心
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.01,1:11:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝对不会伤害你们的 魔药学教授，不要害怕
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.74,1:12:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.58,1:12:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,二
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.20,1:12:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三 - “解除武器”
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.81,1:12:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他有没有怎样？ - 谁理他？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.64,1:12:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是非常棒的想法，斯内普教授
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.88,1:12:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别介意我这么说，这实在 太明显了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.67,1:12:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我要阻止你的话 那简直是易如反掌
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.07,1:12:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们能先教导学生
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.56,1:12:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何阻挡有恶意的咒语，那应该会更有帮助，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.80,1:12:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这建议太棒了，斯内普教授
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.47,1:12:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先找自愿者做试范。嗯，波特，韦斯莱，你们来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.15,1:12:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯莱的魔杖，连使用最简单的魔咒都会出事
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.98,1:12:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一伤了波特，还得把他送到医护室
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.71,1:12:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,请容我推荐我学院的学生
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.05,1:13:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔福，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.03,1:13:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祝你好运，波特 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.51,1:13:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔杖就位
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.11,1:13:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你害怕了吗？ - 才怪
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.52,1:13:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我数到三
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.42,1:13:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就开始解除对方的武器，只能够
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.93,1:13:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可不希望这里出任何意外 一
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.23,1:13:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 二 - 为提司塔踢
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.45,1:14:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,里吐三卜啦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.66,1:14:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过只能解除武装
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.74,1:14:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我的“乌龙出洞”
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.27,1:14:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动，波特 我来帮你除掉它
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.43,1:14:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来吧，斯内普教授 瓦拉太，阿蛇德利
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.23,1:15:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇蛇，哎唯尼斯卡
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.60,1:15:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚是在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.75,1:15:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个蛇佬腔？你怎么都没告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.83,1:15:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是什么？ - 你可以跟蛇交谈？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.21,1:15:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道，我曾经在动物园放出一条蟒蛇 去攻击我的表哥达力
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.53,1:15:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就那一次又怎么样？我打赌这里很多人都做得到
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.66,1:16:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，没人做得到，这不是一般的天赋，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.94,1:16:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有不好的意义
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.80,1:16:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么不好？如果不是我叫那条蛇 不要攻击贾斯汀的话
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.71,1:16:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是跟它说这个 - 你也在，你应该有听到
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.38,1:16:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到你在说蛇佬腔，那是蛇的语言
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.45,1:16:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了另外一种语言
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.39,1:16:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我不懂
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.96,1:16:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么会说我不知道的语言？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.89,1:16:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道，听起来就像是 你在叫那条蛇去做什么事
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.10,1:16:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.07,1:16:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯莱特林的象征标志是蛇
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.23,1:16:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是因为 萨拉斯莱特林是个蛇佬腔 - 他也可以跟蛇交谈
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.01,1:16:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.21,1:16:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在整个学校都开始以为 你是他的曾曾曾曾孙了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.77,1:16:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我不是
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.48,1:16:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能是我
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.55,1:16:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一千年前的人
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.75,1:16:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据目前的了解你很有可能就是
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.33,1:17:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是谁，海德薇？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.33,1:17:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.89,1:17:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,公共休息室见
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.94,1:18:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么说，我叫贾斯汀躲在我们宿舍里
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.38,1:18:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是说，要是波特把他当作下一个目标的话
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.24,1:18:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最好还是先躲一阵子
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.02,1:18:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是，为什么他要攻击贾斯汀？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.94,1:18:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾斯汀不小心告诉波特自己是麻瓜出身
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.58,1:18:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定波特是斯莱特林的继承人？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.42,1:18:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯哪，他是一个蛇语者
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.38,1:18:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都知道这是黑巫师的标志
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.24,1:18:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听过哪个平常人能和蛇交谈的？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.27,1:18:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们管斯莱特林叫蛇佬腔
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.81,1:18:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但哈利看起来总是那么亲切
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.72,1:18:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码，他正是让‘那个人’消失的人
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.31,1:18:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那大概是‘那个人’第一次想杀他的原因
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.66,1:19:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为他不想有一个黑巫师跟他竞争
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.68,1:19:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，哈利，你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.13,1:19:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格，什么你在这儿干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.14,1:19:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这学期被杀死的第二只
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.39,1:19:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,既不是狐狸也不是黄鼠狼
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.93,1:19:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在征得邓布利多校长的同意的情况下…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.56,1:19:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,…在鸡笼附近施魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.57,1:19:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧！怎么看起来很烦恼的样子
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.69,1:19:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.82,1:19:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我得走了，我有很多研究要做
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.73,1:20:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要血
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.66,1:20:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀人
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.16,1:20:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀戮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.10,1:20:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀戮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.90,1:20:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀戮时间到啰
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.64,1:21:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,当场被逮到
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.08,1:21:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一次我要你待不下去，波特
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.44,1:21:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记住我的话
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.08,1:21:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，费尔奇，你 你不懂
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.84,1:21:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.25,1:21:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓不是我做的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.83,1:21:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这已经不是我能处理的了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.46,1:21:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多教授正在等你
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.98,1:22:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰镇柠檬汁
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.68,1:22:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多教授
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.21,1:23:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想什么？哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.86,1:23:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在想 你到底有没有把我分对学院
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.74,1:23:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，你是特别难处理，没错
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.35,1:23:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我还是坚持我原先的看法
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.94,1:23:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在斯莱特林会有所成就
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.63,1:23:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.10,1:23:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.89,1:24:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.33,1:24:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只鸟 我完全帮不了它
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.55,1:24:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它突然全身都着火了 - 喔，也该是时候了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.87,1:24:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,它这几天看来糟透了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.49,1:24:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜你到燃烧日才见到它
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.28,1:24:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,福克斯 它是一只凤凰
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.64,1:24:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,凤凰在死亡的时候会化成火焰
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.14,1:24:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后它们
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.33,1:24:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,会在灰烬中重生
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.93,1:24:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,凤凰真是迷人的生物
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.05,1:24:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们载得动 比它重的东西，而且
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.09,1:24:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们的眼泪可以治病
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.45,1:24:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多教授，等等 听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.53,1:24:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多教授，绝对不是哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.00,1:24:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格，如果有需要的话 我可以到魔法部帮他做证
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.29,1:25:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.94,1:25:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧张
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.72,1:25:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.93,1:25:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利他会攻击任何人 - 你当然不会
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.11,1:25:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对呀 我
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.08,1:25:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我出去外面等你们 - 好
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.83,1:25:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不认为那是我做的 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.53,1:25:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不认为会是你
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.24,1:25:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我要问你
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.59,1:25:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有 什么事情你想告诉我
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.02,1:25:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.05,1:25:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.63,1:25:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.91,1:25:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以走了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.39,1:26:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，大家快看，他是斯莱特林的继承人
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.94,1:26:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心，他是一个极端邪恶的巫师
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.35,1:26:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂，过来哈利，弗莱德和乔治只是开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.47,1:26:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,也只有他们这样
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.79,1:26:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,半数同学认为你每天晚上赶往密室
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.01,1:26:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在乎
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.67,1:26:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们是对的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.15,1:26:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.70,1:26:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢，来吧 - 听我说，我不知道我能说蛇语
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.67,1:26:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他什么我自己不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.69,1:26:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.50,1:26:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你能做点什么
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.94,1:27:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至是可怕的事情 而且不知道已经做了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.81,1:27:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会相信，哈利，我知道你不相信
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.90,1:27:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,过几天你会感觉更好，马尔福也会休假回家
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.27,1:27:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么会使人感觉更好
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.67,1:27:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为几天后，变身水就炼好了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.16,1:27:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,几天后 我们可以知道谁是真的斯莱特林继承人
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.14,1:27:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都准备好了只要加点要变的人的一部份进去就可以了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.83,1:27:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉克跟高尔
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.82,1:27:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时我们还得注意真正的克拉克和高尔
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.75,1:27:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们见马尔福的时候不会忽然出现
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.32,1:28:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么做？ - 我通通都想好了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.19,1:28:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里头加了点安眠药水
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.93,1:28:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单但非常有效
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.93,1:28:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在等他们睡着了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.49,1:28:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们藏到飞天扫帚柜，再拔他们几根头发
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.77,1:28:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿他们的制服
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.82,1:28:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你要去拔谁的头发？ - 我早就准备好了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.14,1:28:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,米莉森·布洛德 斯莱特林的学生
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.51,1:28:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从她长袍上拿下来的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.91,1:28:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看看变身水怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.52,1:28:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要让克拉克和高尔看到这个
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.47,1:28:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，罗恩，或许 该让我来
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.00,1:28:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.27,1:28:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,“浮上半空”
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.73,1:29:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.25,1:29:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.01,1:29:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是有够笨
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.01,1:29:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，动手了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.20,1:29:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂，你们拿到头发了？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.72,1:29:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？ - 斯莱特林长袍
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.72,1:29:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不把它从洗衣房偷了出来
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.44,1:29:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要喝那个？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.48,1:29:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.64,1:30:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,变身一个小时后我们就会恢复原状
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.33,1:30:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,头发放进去
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.81,1:30:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,要喝克拉克的一部份
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.74,1:30:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.35,1:30:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快要吐了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.69,1:30:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.40,1:31:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.60,1:31:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.83,1:31:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.88,1:31:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的声音还是没有变
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.31,1:31:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须装出克拉克的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.25,1:31:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呃，我的老天啊 - 太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.17,1:31:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赫敏呢？ - 我
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.63,1:31:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我不能去了，你们两个先走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.93,1:31:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏，你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.70,1:31:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走，别浪费时间
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.50,1:31:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.67,1:32:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斯莱特林的公共休息室应该在那边 - 好
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.01,1:32:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.16,1:32:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会在
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.38,1:32:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说，你怎么会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.35,1:32:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是学院的级长
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.25,1:32:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,反倒是你们这么晚了，还在走道上游荡，想干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.29,1:32:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.29,1:32:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是… - 克拉克，高尔，你们俩要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.47,1:32:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么晚了，还要去大厅大吃大喝吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.00,1:32:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛戴眼镜？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.14,1:32:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呃，我在看书 - 看书？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.14,1:32:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你还认识字
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.32,1:32:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你在这里干什么？韦斯莱
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.58,1:32:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意你讲话的态度，马尔福
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.39,1:33:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.20,1:33:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,真看不出韦斯莱会是纯种，看他们的丢脸举动
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.27,1:33:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们让巫师世界蒙羞，全家都是
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.94,1:33:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么了？克拉克
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.45,1:33:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肚子痛
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.18,1:33:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗？我真惊讶预言家日报 竟然没有报导学校的攻击事件
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.19,1:33:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想一定是被邓布利多压下来
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.92,1:33:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸总是说邓布利多是霍格沃茨
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.73,1:33:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有史以来最大的祸害 - 才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.77,1:33:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.14,1:33:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 还有人比邓布利多还要糟吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.98,1:33:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,说啊，是不是？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.91,1:33:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特啊
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.35,1:34:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得好
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.92,1:34:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得一点也没错
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.13,1:34:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣人波特
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.99,1:34:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家竟然 还把他当成斯莱特林的继承人
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.53,1:34:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你一定知道后面的主使者是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.30,1:34:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过我不知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.90,1:34:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到底要跟你说几次？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.48,1:34:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.79,1:34:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我爸告诉过我
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.55,1:34:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,密室在五十年前曾经被打开过
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.62,1:34:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不肯说是谁打开的，只说他们被开除了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.30,1:34:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次密室被打开的时候，有个泥巴种被杀了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.13,1:34:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这次密室被打开，迟早也会有泥巴种被杀掉
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.04,1:34:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我的话
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.04,1:34:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望那是赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.38,1:34:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.75,1:35:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们今天有点怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.41,1:35:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他肚子痛
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.78,1:35:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.02,1:35:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 的疤
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.27,1:35:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,头发
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.78,1:35:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，你们去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.09,1:35:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点穿帮了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.53,1:35:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏，快，我们有好多东西要告诉你
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.25,1:35:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.62,1:35:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，你们自己去看，真是好恶喔
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.27,1:36:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.25,1:36:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.89,1:36:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,记不记得我跟你们说过
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.00,1:36:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,变身水只能用来变成人类
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.33,1:36:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从米莉森布洛德身上，拔出来的是猫的毛
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.73,1:36:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看看我的脸
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.22,1:36:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长尾巴了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.30,1:36:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟赫敏谈过了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.15,1:36:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还得在医院里面待几天
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.89,1:36:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到她不再吐毛球出来
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.34,1:36:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.80,1:36:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好恶心
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.04,1:36:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哭泣的桃金娘的洗手间淹水了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.06,1:37:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也是来对我丢东西的吗？ - 我为什么要对你丢东西？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.63,1:37:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道？我正坐着，想着我自己的心事
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.17,1:37:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,忽然就有人把东西丢到我身上
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.70,1:37:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你丢东西应该没有关系吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.77,1:37:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说，那些东西又打不到你
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.21,1:37:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家想反正打不到我，就拼命对我丢东西
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.87,1:37:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,想得十分，就穿过她的肚子
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.55,1:37:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,想得五十分就得穿过她的头
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.55,1:37:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到底是谁对你丢东西？ - 我不知道，我没有看到人
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.32,1:37:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚好坐在马桶里面，思考着死亡
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.76,1:37:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后那个东西，就从我头上穿过去了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.38,1:38:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这本日记上写有名字
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.76,1:38:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆·M·里德尔
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.36,1:38:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆·M·里德尔？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.92,1:38:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,停一下，我知道这个名字 你怎么知道的？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.72,1:38:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了，我受罚留班的那天晚上
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.96,1:38:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被罚擦干净奖品室的银银质奖杯
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.28,1:38:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得 因为我把鼻涕虫呕吐在汤姆·里德尔的奖杯上？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.00,1:38:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么样的奖杯 - 五十年前他赢得的
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.88,1:38:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他对学校所做的特殊贡献或其他事情
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.64,1:38:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 五十年前？你确定？- 是的，怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.44,1:38:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得马尔福告诉你什么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.60,1:38:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上一次密室被打开是… - 五十年前
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.90,1:38:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着汤姆·里德尔在事情发生时在霍格沃茨
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.12,1:39:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是否记录了他看到了什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.96,1:39:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能他知道密室在哪儿…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.44,1:39:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样打开它 甚至什么样的生物住在里边
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.20,1:39:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,果真如此的话，这次攻击背后的罪犯不会愿意这本日记到处乱放
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.16,1:39:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.60,1:39:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个伟大的推论，郝敏，但有一点微小的缺陷
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.17,1:39:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是，日记上什么都没写
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.47,1:39:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否介意？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.88,1:39:54.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（汤姆·M·里德尔）
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.27,1:40:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字叫做
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.77,1:40:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.07,1:40:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.79,1:40:37.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你好，哈利·波特）
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.66,1:40:39.89,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我叫做汤姆·里德尔）
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.69,1:40:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 任何
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.52,1:40:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟密室有关 的事吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.48,1:41:02.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（知道）
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.48,1:41:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.65,1:41:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.63,1:41:17.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（不行）
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.90,1:41:25.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（可是我能让你亲自去看）
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.44,1:41:32.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（让我带你回到五十年前）
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.15,1:41:38.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（六月十三日）
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.22,1:42:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，你能不能告诉我出了什么事？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.94,1:42:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是汤姆·里德尔？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.47,1:42:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，你听得到我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.66,1:42:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.20,1:42:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.02,1:42:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多教授
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.10,1:42:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.50,1:43:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么晚还在外面游荡是非常不智的举动
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.30,1:43:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，教授，我只是
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.80,1:43:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须亲自看看谣言是不是真的？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.57,1:43:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕是真的，汤姆，那是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.64,1:43:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,学校的事也是啰
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.91,1:43:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经无家可归了，他们不会真的关闭霍格沃茨吧
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.68,1:43:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都了解，汤姆，但是
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.98,1:43:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪佩特校长可能没有其他选择
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.09,1:43:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果一切都停止，如果幕后的主使者能被捉到呢
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.67,1:43:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.90,1:43:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事想要跟我说呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.94,1:43:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有，没事
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.41,1:43:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧 你可以走了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.50,1:43:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授晚安
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.33,1:44:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们快走 - 晚安，海格
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.85,1:44:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不告发你了，我知道你无意杀害任何人，可是
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.36,1:44:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可以，你根本不懂
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.83,1:44:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个死去女孩的父母明天就会到了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.18,1:44:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨唯一能为他们做的 就是处决杀害他们女儿的凶手
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.30,1:44:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是它做的，阿拉格克绝对不会杀人，不可能
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.53,1:44:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪兽是不能拿来当宠物的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.07,1:44:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快让开 - 不要
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.87,1:44:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快让开，海格 - 不要
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.01,1:44:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,西放阿魁里昂
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.58,1:45:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿拉尼亚艾特秘
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.82,1:45:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿拉格克
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.46,1:45:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿拉格克
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.08,1:45:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能放你走
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.16,1:45:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的行为让你失去学习资格，你会被开除
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.00,1:45:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格，海格
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.42,1:45:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.31,1:45:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩，罗恩，醒醒
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.47,1:45:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.95,1:45:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是海格做的，五十年前打开密室的人就是海格
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.99,1:46:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能会是海格 这 绝对不可能
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.09,1:46:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们根本不认识这个汤姆·里德尔 他听起来像个讨厌的告密鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.33,1:46:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个怪兽杀了人，罗恩，换成是我们会怎么做
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.13,1:46:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，海格是我们的朋友，我们可以直接去问他
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.30,1:46:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那谈话的气氛一定很好 「你好，海格…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.14,1:46:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们，你最近有没有在学校 放出什么毛茸茸的怪物「
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.14,1:46:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,毛茸茸的怪物，你们该不会是在说我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.68,1:46:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.18,1:46:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿这是什么？海格
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.25,1:46:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，这个 肉食杀虫剂，曼德拉草要用的
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.51,1:46:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据斯普劳特教授所说，它们还需要长一段时间 等它们被咬的地方都清理干净了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.72,1:46:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就可以把曼德拉草剁一剁，熬一熬
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.50,1:47:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后医院里面那些被石化的人，就可以恢复了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.17,1:47:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这段期间呢，你们三个
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.30,1:47:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好能够乖一点，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.26,1:47:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，纳威
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.26,1:47:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，不知道谁干的，你最好过去看一下
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.22,1:47:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.32,1:47:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是格兰芬多的学生，别的学院的人根本进不来
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.38,1:47:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非下手的人不是学生
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.09,1:47:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是谁，他们一定在找什么东西
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.59,1:48:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.75,1:48:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆·里德尔的日记不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.39,1:48:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.27,1:48:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家全力以赴，赫夫帕夫根本不是我们的对手
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.13,1:48:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们比他们厉害，迅速又精明
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.52,1:48:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别说他们怕死哈利了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.29,1:48:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就怕飞得太快被哈利给石化了 - 喔，有道理
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.87,1:48:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦格教授
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.84,1:48:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这场比赛取消了 - 怎么可以取消呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.35,1:48:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点，伍德，你跟其他队员，马上回到格兰芬多塔楼，快
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.91,1:48:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特，你跟我一块去找罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.24,1:48:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件事必须让你们两个知道
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.59,1:48:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,先警告你们，这件事可能会吓到你们
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.57,1:48:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.40,1:48:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是在图书馆附近被发现的
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.20,1:48:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还带着这个
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.61,1:48:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道这镜子有什么意义吗
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.48,1:49:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.16,1:49:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位同学请注意
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.76,1:49:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,基于近来发生的事件，我们必须马上施行新的规定
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.83,1:49:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个学生每晚都必须在六点前回到学院的公共休息室
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.30,1:49:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,每位同学上课时，都会有一位教授陪同前往
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.45,1:49:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人可以例外
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.85,1:49:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须告诉各位
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.23,1:49:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非进行攻击的凶手被逮到
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.05,1:49:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则就得关闭学校
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.59,1:50:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须去跟海格谈谈，我绝不相信是他
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.31,1:50:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是如果上次是他 放怪兽出来的
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.41,1:50:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他一定知道怎么进入密室，那就有头绪了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.92,1:50:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是麦格教授刚刚说
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.37,1:50:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非是去上课，否则不准离开
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.52,1:50:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想该把我爸的隐形斗蓬拿出来用了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.93,1:50:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 耶 - 准备好了？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.80,1:50:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.14,1:50:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？有人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.04,1:51:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你拿那个干嘛？ - 喔，没事，我正在等
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.72,1:51:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么，进来吧，我刚泡了一壶茶
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.12,1:51:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格，你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.03,1:51:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好，我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.43,1:51:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有听说赫敏的事吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.00,1:51:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，有，我已经听说了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.01,1:51:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说，我们想问你一些事情
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.32,1:51:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道是谁打开了密室的门吗
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.14,1:51:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须了解一件事
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.24,1:51:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，躲到斗蓬里
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.64,1:51:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个要保持安静
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.56,1:51:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邓布利多教授 - 晚安，海格
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.21,1:51:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不是 可以进去？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.07,1:51:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了，请进
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.44,1:51:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸的上司
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.13,1:52:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,康奈利·福吉 魔法部部长
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.70,1:52:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说，海格，这个任务很棘手，我非来不可
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.39,1:52:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,三起麻瓜后代被攻击事件，事情闹得太大
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.96,1:52:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 魔法部必须有所行动 - 可是我没
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.27,1:52:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道我没有做
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.33,1:52:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能够明白，福吉
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.22,1:52:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对海格
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.29,1:52:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对的信任
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.68,1:52:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多，你听我说，海格的记录对他很不利
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.18,1:52:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我必须带他走 - 带我走？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.62,1:52:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪儿？不会是阿兹卡班吧
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.31,1:52:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有选择的余地了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.38,1:52:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,福吉，你已经来了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.56,1:52:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.38,1:52:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿干什么？ 快滚出我的房子
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.11,1:52:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.06,1:52:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一点也不想走进你的这个
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.96,1:52:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫房子吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.31,1:52:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.77,1:53:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是有事到学校来，而他们告诉我校长在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.58,1:53:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到学校里去找我，有什么事情呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.28,1:53:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有其他的董事都认为 该是你走路的时候了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.65,1:53:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的停职令
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.07,1:53:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,上头有全部十二名董事的签名
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.16,1:53:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都觉得你似乎越来越糊涂
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.24,1:53:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击事件再继续下去
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.84,1:53:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨的麻瓜后代，很快就死光了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.92,1:53:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想想，这会是我们学校多大的损失
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.42,1:53:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不能把校长免职
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.20,1:53:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他离开后麻瓜后代就一点希望都没有了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.97,1:53:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会有人再被杀掉的
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.57,1:53:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是这样想的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.11,1:53:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格，冷静一点
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.65,1:53:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果董事们都希望我下课
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.08,1:54:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我当然 应该离开了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.34,1:54:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.24,1:54:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要 霍格沃茨有人发出求救信号
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.95,1:54:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,必定会有人
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.02,1:54:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,伸出援手
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.16,1:54:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是令人感动
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.66,1:54:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,请吧
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.57,1:54:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,福吉
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.69,1:54:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧，海格
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.57,1:54:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,走啊
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.02,1:54:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.48,1:54:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人需要找什么东西的话
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.22,1:54:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们唯一需要做的 就是跟着蜘蛛走
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.26,1:54:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，蜘蛛会引导他们
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.03,1:55:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我想要说的
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.70,1:55:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，对了吗，我还需要有人帮我喂喂牙牙
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.81,1:55:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.95,1:55:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格说得没错
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.25,1:55:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦邓布利多离开，每天都会有攻击发生
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.35,1:55:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.09,1:55:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.36,1:55:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,来，牙牙
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.92,1:55:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.45,1:56:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.92,1:56:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没听到海格说的话吗？跟着蜘蛛走
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.33,1:56:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们往禁忌林去了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.00,1:56:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是蜘蛛？ 为什么 他就不说跟着蝴蝶走呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.25,1:56:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西朝这边过来了 小心
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.13,1:56:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听起来像个大家伙 - 大家伙？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.60,1:57:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！哈利！是我们的飞车
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.94,1:57:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一直都呆在这儿，你瞧瞧，森林把它变野了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.94,1:57:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，我们不想失去线索
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.65,1:57:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，我不喜欢这样
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.53,1:57:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利，我真的很不喜欢这样 - 嘘！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.07,1:57:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可不可以回去？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.89,1:57:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.43,1:58:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁来啦？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:47.67,1:58:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要惊慌
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.34,1:58:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.24,1:58:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.41,1:58:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是海格的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.43,1:59:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你是阿拉格克，对不对？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.26,1:59:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.73,1:59:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格从没带人来过我们这里
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.67,1:59:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格有麻烦了，学校里面发生了一些攻击事件
Dialogue: 0,1:59:26.44,1:59:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说那是海格做的
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.54,1:59:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们认为海格又再一次的 打开了密室
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.38,1:59:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.90,1:59:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格没有打开过密室的门
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.75,1:59:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么你不是那个怪兽啰 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.79,1:59:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪兽是在这城堡里诞生的
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.99,1:59:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我是被一个旅行者放在口袋，从一个遥远的地方来的
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.13,1:59:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利 - 不要吵
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.47,1:59:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不是怪兽，那五十年前是谁杀了那个女孩
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.21,2:00:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绝口不提那个东西
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.35,2:00:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们蜘蛛最害怕的一种，非常古老的动物
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.28,2:00:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看过那个动物吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.72,2:00:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格只把我放在一个箱子里养 我从来没见过城堡其他角落
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.72,2:00:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个死去的女孩，是在厕所被发现的
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.06,2:00:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他们指控我时，海格就把我带到这里
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.73,2:00:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利 - 干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:39.61,2:00:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，没事了 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.55,2:00:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们走了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.19,2:00:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,走？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.12,2:00:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕不行
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.06,2:00:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的子女们，因为我的命令而不伤害海格
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.70,2:00:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是当有新鲜的肉自己送上门来的时候
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.26,2:01:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不能再阻止它们了
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.67,2:01:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见，海格的朋友
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.74,2:01:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以害怕了吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.29,2:01:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么咒语可以用的
Dialogue: 0,2:01:21.41,2:01:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个，可是力量不够对付所有的蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,2:01:24.72,2:01:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么需要赫敏的时候，她偏不在
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.97,2:01:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快走
Dialogue: 0,2:01:47.41,2:01:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,“昏昏倒地”
Dialogue: 0,2:01:54.79,2:01:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.11,2:02:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.11,2:02:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴我们出来
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.15,2:02:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,“昏昏倒地”
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.19,2:02:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢了 - 不客气
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.87,2:02:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快离开这里
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.54,2:02:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,2:02:52.31,2:02:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊，快点，开快点
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.25,2:03:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，走
Dialogue: 0,2:03:17.99,2:03:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点飞起来
Dialogue: 0,2:03:21.13,2:03:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞行引擎卡住了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:26.70,2:03:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加油 - 我在努力
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.80,2:04:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着蜘蛛走，跟着蜘蛛走
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.90,2:04:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,等海格从阿兹卡班回来以后，我要杀了他
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.22,2:04:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要我们到那里面去，究竟是为了什么
Dialogue: 0,2:04:24.63,2:04:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们有查出什么吗？ - 我们知道了一件事
Dialogue: 0,2:04:29.40,2:04:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,密室不是被海格打开的
Dialogue: 0,2:04:33.00,2:04:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是无辜的
Dialogue: 0,2:04:50.49,2:04:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望你能好起来，赫敏
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.49,2:04:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你
Dialogue: 0,2:04:56.69,2:04:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很需要你
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.71,2:05:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？ - 罗恩
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.95,2:05:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是赫敏会在图书馆附近遭到攻击的原因
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.95,2:05:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,2:05:26.89,2:05:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们国土漫游的众多可怕怪兽中
Dialogue: 0,2:05:30.02,2:05:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,最危险的就是蛇妖，它们可拥有数百年的寿命
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.83,2:05:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何与蛇妖眼睛接触的人都会马上死去
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.67,2:05:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛闻风便会窜逃，罗恩，就是这个
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.02,2:05:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,密室里面的那个怪兽就是蛇妖
Dialogue: 0,2:05:44.91,2:05:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪我会听到那个声音，它是一条蛇
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.18,2:05:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是如果 看了它的眼睛就会死，那为什么没有人死呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:05.09,2:06:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为没有人看到它的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.96,2:06:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少没有直接看到
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.80,2:06:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,科林是透过照相机看到的
Dialogue: 0,2:06:16.20,2:06:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾斯汀，贾斯汀一定是从尼克爵士后面看到的
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.41,2:06:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克则是直接看到蛇妖，可是他早就死了，不会再死一次
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.58,2:06:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于赫敏 那面镜子
Dialogue: 0,2:06:27.88,2:06:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定是要用镜子探照角落预防蛇妖出现
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.42,2:06:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛丽斯太太呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.85,2:06:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她肯定没有拿照相机，或镜子什么的
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.93,2:06:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是水
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.26,2:06:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天晚上地板上有水，洛丽斯太太是看到蛇妖的倒影
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.97,2:06:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛将闻风窜逃
Dialogue: 0,2:06:54.08,2:06:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这一切都符合 - 那蛇妖是怎么到处活动的？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:57.98,2:07:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条恶心的绿色大蛇不可能不被发现
Dialogue: 0,2:07:01.05,2:07:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赫敏也想出答案了 - 水管，它是利用排水管道
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.82,2:07:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得阿拉格克说的，五十年前死去的那个女孩吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.26,2:07:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是在厕所死的，如果她一直没走呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:16.16,2:07:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哭泣的桃金娘
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.47,2:07:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有学生，请马上回到学院寝室去
Dialogue: 0,2:07:22.67,2:07:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的教授请到二楼走廊集合
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.11,2:07:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都看到了，斯莱特林的继承人，又一次留下了讯息
Dialogue: 0,2:07:37.12,2:07:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最深的恐惧就要成真
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.49,2:07:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个学生被怪兽抓走，带进了密室里面
Dialogue: 0,2:07:45.13,2:07:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须马上把所有学生送回家，霍格沃茨恐怕得永远关闭了
Dialogue: 0,2:07:53.17,2:07:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，睡过头了，没错过什么吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.77,2:08:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个学生被怪兽抓走了，你表现的机会终于来了
Dialogue: 0,2:08:00.31,2:08:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 表 表现 - 你昨天晚上不是说过
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.41,2:08:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直都知道 密室的入口在哪里吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.32,2:08:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好啊，就麻烦你 一个人去对付那个怪兽
Dialogue: 0,2:08:14.96,2:08:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 毕竟我们从没看过你大展身手 - 没问题
Dialogue: 0,2:08:20.33,2:08:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃，那我先回我办公室去
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.37,2:08:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备一下
Dialogue: 0,2:08:29.24,2:08:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个怪兽到底把谁抓走了？
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.61,2:08:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,金妮·韦斯莱
Dialogue: 0,2:08:45.85,2:08:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的骨骸将永远躺在密室里
Dialogue: 0,2:08:52.96,2:08:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,金妮
Dialogue: 0,2:08:56.83,2:09:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛哈特或许很没用，可是他现在正打算进入密室
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.50,2:09:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去把我们知道的一切告诉他
Dialogue: 0,2:09:04.57,2:09:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授，我们有一些事情要告诉你
Dialogue: 0,2:09:08.91,2:09:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要离开这里吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:11.05,2:09:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃，是啊 呃，我有急事 我非走不可，我得走
Dialogue: 0,2:09:14.32,2:09:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我妹妹她怎么办？ - 恩…
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.89,2:09:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于这件不幸的事没有人比我更悲痛了
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.52,2:09:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我们黑魔法防御学的教授·你不能就这样走
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.69,2:09:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须说当我接受这个工作的时候，工作内容里面并没有说到
Dialogue: 0,2:09:28.86,2:09:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算逃走
Dialogue: 0,2:09:30.20,2:09:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可是你的书把你说得那么伟大 - 书会误导的
Dialogue: 0,2:09:33.17,2:09:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是你写的啊，拜托 - 你们用一下你们的常识好吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:35.90,2:09:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不让人们相信我书中经历，我的书哪会卖得这么好
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.88,2:09:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个骗子
Dialogue: 0,2:09:42.64,2:09:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是把别的巫师的英雄事迹揽在自己身上
Dialogue: 0,2:09:45.61,2:09:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总会一些什么法术吧
Dialogue: 0,2:09:47.72,2:09:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，既然你都这么问了，我的遗忘术还蛮强的
Dialogue: 0,2:09:52.62,2:09:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然那些巫师 岂不是会来跟我啰唆吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:55.29,2:09:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我的书就没有说服力了
Dialogue: 0,2:09:58.56,2:10:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我也要让你们失忆
Dialogue: 0,2:10:04.80,2:10:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你连想都不要想
Dialogue: 0,2:10:18.45,2:10:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,2:10:22.32,2:10:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，你好
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.29,2:10:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来做什么？ - 我来问你 你是怎么死的？
Dialogue: 0,2:10:32.83,2:10:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真的很可怕
Dialogue: 0,2:10:35.43,2:10:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切就在这里发生，就在这间厕所里面
Dialogue: 0,2:10:39.30,2:10:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为奥利夫·洪贝取笑我的眼镜，所以我躲在这里
Dialogue: 0,2:10:43.50,2:10:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在哭，突然就听到有人走进来
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.58,2:10:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是谁？桃金娘 - 我不知道，我正在难过
Dialogue: 0,2:10:56.22,2:10:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是他们说了一些奇怪的东西，好像是种什么语言
Dialogue: 0,2:10:59.79,2:11:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上听出是个男孩的声音 所以我把门打开，准备叫他 走开，然后
Dialogue: 0,2:11:07.33,2:11:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就死了 - 就这样吗？怎么会？
Dialogue: 0,2:11:12.33,2:11:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只记得我看到了一双好大的黄眼珠
Dialogue: 0,2:11:17.00,2:11:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那个洗脸槽里
Dialogue: 0,2:11:45.93,2:11:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这儿了
Dialogue: 0,2:11:48.87,2:11:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有错，罗恩，我想这一定就是密室的入口
Dialogue: 0,2:11:55.68,2:12:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说话，哈利，快用蛇语说话
Dialogue: 0,2:12:09.37,2:12:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,[蛇语]
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.07,2:12:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太棒了，哈利 - 哎呀，做得好 这样我就放心了
Dialogue: 0,2:12:56.34,2:12:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里应该不需要我了
Dialogue: 0,2:12:59.21,2:13:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里很需要你
Dialogue: 0,2:13:02.91,2:13:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你先下去 - 让我下去有什么好处
Dialogue: 0,2:13:06.18,2:13:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,总比我们下去好
Dialogue: 0,2:13:08.72,2:13:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 说得还蛮有道理的
Dialogue: 0,2:13:15.92,2:13:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真的不想先下去
Dialogue: 0,2:13:25.47,2:13:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下面真的好脏
Dialogue: 0,2:13:29.17,2:13:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了，我们下去 - 喔，哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:13:34.11,2:13:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你死在下面的话，我很欢迎你共用我的厕所
Dialogue: 0,2:13:41.58,2:13:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了，桃金娘
Dialogue: 0,2:14:12.65,2:14:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 一听到任何动静，马上闭上你的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,2:14:18.79,2:14:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,走啊
Dialogue: 0,2:14:24.16,2:14:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,2:14:32.53,2:14:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？ - 这看起来很像 蛇
Dialogue: 0,2:14:37.94,2:14:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是蛇的皮 - 好可怕
Dialogue: 0,2:14:41.78,2:14:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这条蛇大概有六十尺长吧 - 可能不只
Dialogue: 0,2:14:49.48,2:14:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的胆子还真大
Dialogue: 0,2:14:56.16,2:15:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒险结束了，孩子们，不过全世界
Dialogue: 0,2:15:02.76,2:15:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会知道这个故事，我如何因为晚了一步而救不了那女孩
Dialogue: 0,2:15:08.57,2:15:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个又如何 因为看到她的尸体
Dialogue: 0,2:15:12.24,2:15:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,过于悲伤而失去记忆
Dialogue: 0,2:15:16.08,2:15:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:15:18.65,2:15:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先吧，哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,2:15:21.22,2:15:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你的记忆，说再见吧
Dialogue: 0,2:15:26.45,2:15:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,空空，遗忘
Dialogue: 0,2:15:55.23,2:16:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:16:02.32,2:16:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗恩，罗恩，你没事吧？ - 我没事
Dialogue: 0,2:16:09.20,2:16:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,2:16:11.63,2:16:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.84,2:16:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗恩·韦斯莱 - 真的
Dialogue: 0,2:16:17.67,2:16:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,2:16:22.31,2:16:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛哈特的遗忘咒反弹回去，他连自己是谁都忘了
Dialogue: 0,2:16:26.95,2:16:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里真是一个奇怪的地方
Dialogue: 0,2:16:31.62,2:16:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你住这儿？
Dialogue: 0,2:16:34.46,2:16:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 真的
Dialogue: 0,2:16:41.56,2:16:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我现在要做什么 - 你留在这里
Dialogue: 0,2:16:43.53,2:16:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,把石头搬开，这样等我们回来就可以通过
Dialogue: 0,2:16:46.63,2:16:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我现在要去找金妮 - 好
Dialogue: 0,2:17:06.93,2:17:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,[蛇语]
Dialogue: 0,2:18:14.25,2:18:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,金妮
Dialogue: 0,2:18:23.53,2:18:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,金妮 你千万不能死，快醒醒
Dialogue: 0,2:18:27.90,2:18:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你快醒醒
Dialogue: 0,2:18:30.27,2:18:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她醒不了了
Dialogue: 0,2:18:37.88,2:18:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆，汤姆·里德尔，你说她醒不了了是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,2:18:42.38,2:18:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她… - 她还 她还活着，但醒不了
Dialogue: 0,2:18:46.75,2:18:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是鬼吗？ - 记忆
Dialogue: 0,2:18:49.22,2:18:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是留存 在日记中五十年的记忆
Dialogue: 0,2:18:54.29,2:18:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就跟冰块一样冷，金妮，求求你别死，快起来
Dialogue: 0,2:18:59.67,2:19:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须帮帮我，汤姆，这里头有蛇妖
Dialogue: 0,2:19:02.24,2:19:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,它受到召唤才会出现
Dialogue: 0,2:19:07.64,2:19:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把我的魔杖给我 - 你不会需要它的
Dialogue: 0,2:19:11.51,2:19:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要赶快离开，我们必须救她 - 我恐怕帮不了你了
Dialogue: 0,2:19:15.08,2:19:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道，可怜的金妮变得越弱，我就变得更强
Dialogue: 0,2:19:20.49,2:19:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，哈利，就是金妮·韦斯莱打开了密室的门
Dialogue: 0,2:19:25.16,2:19:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不会是她，不可能是她
Dialogue: 0,2:19:27.66,2:19:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是金妮放出蛇妖攻击那些泥巴种和费尔奇的猫
Dialogue: 0,2:19:31.03,2:19:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是 她在墙上留下那些恐吓讯息
Dialogue: 0,2:19:33.63,2:19:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？ - 是我要她这么做的
Dialogue: 0,2:19:37.10,2:19:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会慢慢发现 我很有说服力 当然金妮并不知自己做了什么
Dialogue: 0,2:19:42.24,2:19:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过她从各种迹象猜出来了
Dialogue: 0,2:19:46.11,2:19:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,日记的力量把她给吓坏了
Dialogue: 0,2:19:48.78,2:19:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是她试着把日记丢到女厕所
Dialogue: 0,2:19:51.32,2:19:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,而最后 理所当然，被你捡到
Dialogue: 0,2:19:55.86,2:19:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是我最急切想见面的人
Dialogue: 0,2:19:59.56,2:20:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么那么急着想要见我？
Dialogue: 0,2:20:02.03,2:20:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,金妮告诉我你的事，我必须见你一面
Dialogue: 0,2:20:05.57,2:20:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我决定把我逮到那个蠢汉海格的经过
Dialogue: 0,2:20:09.00,2:20:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让你看一看，以赢取你的信任 - 海格是我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,2:20:13.11,2:20:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你陷害了他，对不对？ - 我的说法跟海格的不同
Dialogue: 0,2:20:17.88,2:20:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有邓布利多才相信他是无辜的
Dialogue: 0,2:20:21.32,2:20:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多也看穿了你的谎言
Dialogue: 0,2:20:23.65,2:20:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那之后他就令人厌烦的监视着我
Dialogue: 0,2:20:27.29,2:20:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我还待在学校的时候再打开密室，实在是太冒险了
Dialogue: 0,2:20:30.76,2:20:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我决定留下我的日记
Dialogue: 0,2:20:32.76,2:20:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,把十六岁的我保存在日记里头
Dialogue: 0,2:20:35.03,2:20:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到有一天，我能够引导另一个人来完成
Dialogue: 0,2:20:37.90,2:20:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉查·斯莱特林的伟大使命
Dialogue: 0,2:20:40.87,2:20:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没有完成
Dialogue: 0,2:20:43.30,2:20:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过几个小时，曼德拉草药就长成了
Dialogue: 0,2:20:46.44,2:20:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,被石化的那些人马上就会醒过来了
Dialogue: 0,2:20:49.58,2:20:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没告诉过你吗？杀掉泥巴种对我来说已经没那么重要
Dialogue: 0,2:20:55.08,2:20:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这几个月来，我的新目标 就是你
Dialogue: 0,2:21:01.32,2:21:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个没什么魔法天赋的婴儿
Dialogue: 0,2:21:05.09,2:21:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然可以打败 有史以来最伟大的巫师
Dialogue: 0,2:21:08.10,2:21:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是如何逃生？为什么伏地魔的力量被摧毁了
Dialogue: 0,2:21:11.20,2:21:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却毫发无伤只留下伤痕
Dialogue: 0,2:21:13.77,2:21:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛那么关心我如何逃生？ 伏地魔又不是你那个时代的人
Dialogue: 0,2:21:18.11,2:21:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏地魔 就是我的过去，现在，还有未来
Dialogue: 0,2:21:25.56,2:21:33.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（汤姆·M·里德尔）
Dialogue: 0,2:21:39.87,2:21:44.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我是伏地魔）
Dialogue: 0,2:21:45.00,2:21:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你就是斯莱特林的继承人
Dialogue: 0,2:21:51.61,2:21:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就是伏地魔 - 当然，你该不会认为
Dialogue: 0,2:21:55.38,2:21:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会继续留着 我那肮脏麻瓜父亲的姓吧
Dialogue: 0,2:22:00.05,2:22:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以，我为自己取了新名字，我知道当我成为
Dialogue: 0,2:22:04.38,2:22:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界最伟大的魔法师后 整个巫师世界将会害怕提到这个名字
Dialogue: 0,2:22:08.76,2:22:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多教授才是全世界最伟大的魔法师
Dialogue: 0,2:22:12.09,2:22:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不过是凭着一点记忆，就把邓布利多给赶走了
Dialogue: 0,2:22:15.66,2:22:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会离开的，因我们仍然有人对他表示忠诚
Dialogue: 0,2:22:27.14,2:22:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,福克斯
Dialogue: 0,2:22:44.42,2:22:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来这就是邓布利多送给他拥护者的东西
Dialogue: 0,2:22:48.16,2:22:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只鸟，跟一顶破帽子
Dialogue: 0,2:22:54.98,2:22:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,[蛇语]
Dialogue: 0,2:23:05.15,2:23:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们展现伏地魔王的力量 由斯莱特林的继承人对抗大名鼎鼎的
Dialogue: 0,2:23:09.85,2:23:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,2:23:24.98,2:23:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,[蛇语]
Dialogue: 0,2:23:27.20,2:23:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的蛇佬腔救不了你的，哈利，它只听我的命令
Dialogue: 0,2:24:01.74,2:24:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,2:24:03.74,2:24:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的凤凰或许可以弄瞎蛇妖，但是蛇妖还是可以听得到你
Dialogue: 0,2:25:50.24,2:25:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，哈利，整个过程就快完成了
Dialogue: 0,2:25:53.71,2:25:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过几分钟金妮·韦斯莱就会死，而我将不再只是个记忆
Dialogue: 0,2:25:58.79,2:26:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏地魔即将回来
Dialogue: 0,2:26:01.82,2:26:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且充满 生命力
Dialogue: 0,2:26:06.76,2:26:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,金妮
Dialogue: 0,2:28:24.50,2:28:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,很神奇，是不是？
Dialogue: 0,2:28:26.27,2:28:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇妖的毒液侵入人体的速度果然十分迅速
Dialogue: 0,2:28:30.44,2:28:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你大概只剩下几分钟好活
Dialogue: 0,2:28:33.44,2:28:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很快就会去陪你的泥巴种母亲，哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:28:42.48,2:28:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好笑，一本书就能造成这么大的伤害
Dialogue: 0,2:28:46.32,2:28:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其 拿到它的人还是个傻女孩
Dialogue: 0,2:28:54.23,2:28:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:28:58.87,2:29:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手，不可以
Dialogue: 0,2:29:53.78,2:29:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,金妮
Dialogue: 0,2:29:57.45,2:29:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:29:59.29,2:30:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我做的，可是我发誓，我不是故意的
Dialogue: 0,2:30:03.43,2:30:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆·里德尔害我的，还有
Dialogue: 0,2:30:07.47,2:30:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，你受伤了
Dialogue: 0,2:30:10.47,2:30:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 0,2:30:12.14,2:30:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,金妮，你必须想办法先出去
Dialogue: 0,2:30:15.94,2:30:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺着密道走，你就会遇到罗恩了
Dialogue: 0,2:30:31.36,2:30:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的很棒，福克斯
Dialogue: 0,2:30:34.59,2:30:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的行动还不够快
Dialogue: 0,2:30:57.82,2:30:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,2:30:59.82,2:31:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,凤凰的眼泪可以治病
Dialogue: 0,2:31:04.29,2:31:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,2:31:07.83,2:31:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了，金妮
Dialogue: 0,2:31:11.10,2:31:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,全结束了
Dialogue: 0,2:31:14.30,2:31:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是个回忆而已
Dialogue: 0,2:31:19.74,2:31:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,太神奇了，好像魔法
Dialogue: 0,2:31:36.36,2:31:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两位一定明白
Dialogue: 0,2:31:39.19,2:31:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在过去的这几个小时里，你们已违反了将近几十条校规
Dialogue: 0,2:31:45.37,2:31:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，校长
Dialogue: 0,2:31:46.53,2:31:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这足以让学校把你们开除
Dialogue: 0,2:31:49.94,2:31:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，校长
Dialogue: 0,2:31:51.30,2:31:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 你们的所作所为
Dialogue: 0,2:31:55.61,2:31:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,也足以让你们得到
Dialogue: 0,2:31:58.38,2:32:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨的特殊贡献奖
Dialogue: 0,2:32:04.55,2:32:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你，校长
Dialogue: 0,2:32:06.99,2:32:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，韦斯莱同学
Dialogue: 0,2:32:09.46,2:32:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦请猫头鹰，把这封文件送到阿兹卡班
Dialogue: 0,2:32:14.73,2:32:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 也该请我们的猎场管理员回来了
Dialogue: 0,2:32:22.30,2:32:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:32:24.47,2:32:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先，我要谢谢你，哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:32:29.44,2:32:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在密室中一定对我表示出绝对的忠诚
Dialogue: 0,2:32:33.81,2:32:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则 福克斯也不会被召唤到你身边
Dialogue: 0,2:32:40.79,2:32:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于
Dialogue: 0,2:32:42.89,2:32:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二
Dialogue: 0,2:32:44.49,2:32:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得 你好像被什么事困扰着
Dialogue: 0,2:32:49.50,2:32:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不对？哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:32:53.83,2:32:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,2:32:56.74,2:33:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样，我注意到我跟汤姆·里德尔之间
Dialogue: 0,2:33:01.64,2:33:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎在某些 方面，拥有相似的特质
Dialogue: 0,2:33:07.85,2:33:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,2:33:09.22,2:33:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，你是蛇佬腔，哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:33:15.46,2:33:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是因为 伏地魔也是蛇佬腔
Dialogue: 0,2:33:22.20,2:33:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没弄错的话
Dialogue: 0,2:33:25.33,2:33:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在你头上留下疤痕的时候
Dialogue: 0,2:33:29.34,2:33:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,也把一些力量转移到你身上
Dialogue: 0,2:33:32.44,2:33:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏地魔把一些力量转移到了我身上
Dialogue: 0,2:33:38.24,2:33:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这并不是他的原意
Dialogue: 0,2:33:41.85,2:33:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但却是真的
Dialogue: 0,2:33:45.69,2:33:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以分院帽说得没错，我应该就读斯莱特林
Dialogue: 0,2:33:49.16,2:33:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有错，哈利，你的确 拥有一些伏地魔自豪的特色
Dialogue: 0,2:33:54.16,2:33:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚毅果敢，足智多谋
Dialogue: 0,2:33:57.20,2:34:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有也不太遵守既定的规则
Dialogue: 0,2:34:01.87,2:34:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是为什么 分院帽会把你分到格兰芬多？
Dialogue: 0,2:34:06.67,2:34:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是因为我的要求 - 这就对了，哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:34:10.54,2:34:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你跟伏地魔不同的地方
Dialogue: 0,2:34:12.78,2:34:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们成为哪种人的并不是我们的能力
Dialogue: 0,2:34:16.95,2:34:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是我们的选择
Dialogue: 0,2:34:22.76,2:34:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想确定你是否属于格兰芬多
Dialogue: 0,2:34:26.33,2:34:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我建议你仔细的看一看这把剑
Dialogue: 0,2:34:32.20,2:34:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,2:34:39.54,2:34:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈德里克·格兰芬多
Dialogue: 0,2:34:42.38,2:34:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有格兰芬多的真正继承人才能拔出这把剑
Dialogue: 0,2:34:55.36,2:34:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比
Dialogue: 0,2:34:58.02,2:35:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来他就是你的主人，你服侍的家庭就是马尔福家
Dialogue: 0,2:35:04.60,2:35:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我待会儿再跟你算帐
Dialogue: 0,2:35:13.77,2:35:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要挡路，波特
Dialogue: 0,2:35:15.54,2:35:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊，你果然真的回来了
Dialogue: 0,2:35:19.81,2:35:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,当学校的董事们知道金妮·韦斯莱被抓到密室去以后
Dialogue: 0,2:35:22.75,2:35:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们认为该把我找回来了
Dialogue: 0,2:35:27.79,2:35:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可笑 - 很奇怪，卢修斯，有些董事说
Dialogue: 0,2:35:32.03,2:35:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们不同意让我停职的话
Dialogue: 0,2:35:35.86,2:35:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就威胁要诅咒他们全家
Dialogue: 0,2:35:39.17,2:35:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你 这是什么话 - 你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:35:42.80,2:35:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说，唯一以及永远不变的牵挂
Dialogue: 0,2:35:46.74,2:35:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这间学校的利益
Dialogue: 0,2:35:49.74,2:35:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然还有 学生的安危
Dialogue: 0,2:35:58.08,2:36:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想凶手已经逮到了，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:36:02.69,2:36:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,2:36:05.83,2:36:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,2:36:08.83,2:36:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:36:17.27,2:36:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏地魔
Dialogue: 0,2:36:20.97,2:36:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这一次，他不只是利用别人来进行这些行动
Dialogue: 0,2:36:26.98,2:36:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还透过这本日记
Dialogue: 0,2:36:33.29,2:36:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我懂了
Dialogue: 0,2:36:36.29,2:36:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运的是，哈利·波特发现了这件事
Dialogue: 0,2:36:40.86,2:36:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望往后不会再有人把伏地魔的旧东西
Dialogue: 0,2:36:44.70,2:36:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,交到无辜的人手中
Dialogue: 0,2:36:48.27,2:36:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,做出这些事的人将必须承担严重的
Dialogue: 0,2:36:52.57,2:36:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,后果
Dialogue: 0,2:36:55.84,2:36:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 让我们期待
Dialogue: 0,2:36:58.81,2:37:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特同学能永远在这里，拯救所有的人
Dialogue: 0,2:37:05.12,2:37:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心，我一定会
Dialogue: 0,2:37:17.63,2:37:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多，告辞了
Dialogue: 0,2:37:20.80,2:37:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧，多比，我们该走了
Dialogue: 0,2:37:41.62,2:37:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,校长，这本日记可以给我吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:37:52.50,2:37:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔福先生
Dialogue: 0,2:37:54.27,2:37:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔福先生
Dialogue: 0,2:37:56.94,2:37:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有东西要还给你
Dialogue: 0,2:38:00.77,2:38:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还我？我不知道你说些什么
Dialogue: 0,2:38:03.94,2:38:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你很清楚
Dialogue: 0,2:38:05.65,2:38:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天在对角巷，就是你偷偷把这本日记
Dialogue: 0,2:38:08.92,2:38:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,放进了金妮的坩埚里面
Dialogue: 0,2:38:11.05,2:38:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:38:20.96,2:38:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么不想办法去证明
Dialogue: 0,2:38:30.07,2:38:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧，多比
Dialogue: 0,2:38:33.74,2:38:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快打开
Dialogue: 0,2:38:39.31,2:38:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比
Dialogue: 0,2:38:41.01,2:38:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人给了多比一只袜子
Dialogue: 0,2:38:44.45,2:38:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么，我没有
Dialogue: 0,2:38:46.72,2:38:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人给了多比一只袜子
Dialogue: 0,2:38:50.59,2:38:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比现在 自由了
Dialogue: 0,2:39:00.20,2:39:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害我失去了我的仆人
Dialogue: 0,2:39:10.91,2:39:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可以伤害哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,2:39:27.06,2:39:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父母就跟你一样好管闲事
Dialogue: 0,2:39:30.93,2:39:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住我的话，波特，很快的
Dialogue: 0,2:39:34.27,2:39:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的下场，就会跟他们一样的悲惨
Dialogue: 0,2:39:45.18,2:39:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让多比得到自由，多比要怎么报答你呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:39:51.45,2:39:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 答应我一件事就好 - 我什么都答应
Dialogue: 0,2:39:57.66,2:40:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万不要再想办法来救我了
Dialogue: 0,2:40:06.27,2:40:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎回来，尼克爵士 - 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,2:40:09.57,2:40:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安，尼克爵士 - 晚安
Dialogue: 0,2:40:12.28,2:40:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真高兴能见到你 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,2:40:16.41,2:40:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,2:40:20.31,2:40:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赫敏，欢迎回来 - 谢谢你，尼克爵士
Dialogue: 0,2:40:28.19,2:40:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，赫敏回来了
Dialogue: 0,2:40:58.35,2:41:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎你回来，赫敏 - 能回来真好
Dialogue: 0,2:41:02.22,2:41:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你们，你们竟然解开了
Dialogue: 0,2:41:04.99,2:41:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那都是因为有你
Dialogue: 0,2:41:07.43,2:41:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有你，我们什么都解不开 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,2:41:12.50,2:41:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位同学请注意
Dialogue: 0,2:41:19.61,2:41:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在宴会开始之前
Dialogue: 0,2:41:22.31,2:41:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们先掌声感谢斯普劳特教授，和庞弗雷夫人
Dialogue: 0,2:41:28.71,2:41:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢她们用曼德拉草 成功救回了
Dialogue: 0,2:41:33.02,2:41:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有遭到石化的人
Dialogue: 0,2:41:46.20,2:41:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外，基于最近发生的事件，为了表示心意
Dialogue: 0,2:41:49.37,2:41:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,学校决定取消
Dialogue: 0,2:41:51.70,2:41:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的考试
Dialogue: 0,2:41:58.34,2:41:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,2:42:16.86,2:42:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，我来晚了
Dialogue: 0,2:42:24.94,2:42:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为 那只带来释放我文件的猫头鹰迷路了
Dialogue: 0,2:42:29.63,2:42:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只叫埃罗尔的笨鸟
Dialogue: 0,2:42:48.76,2:42:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须告诉你这件事，如果没有你们的话，哈利，罗恩
Dialogue: 0,2:42:54.93,2:42:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然还有你，赫敏
Dialogue: 0,2:42:58.54,2:43:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在 还得待在那个地方
Dialogue: 0,2:43:02.81,2:43:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟你们说的是 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,2:43:15.37,2:43:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨不能没有你
Dialogue: 0,2:54:02.91,2:54:07.87,Title,0,0,0,0,,（《我是谁》 吉德罗·洛哈）
